Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:21.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 星舰开尔文号呼叫星舰基地 - 星舰基地收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- USS Kelvin, go for Starfleet base. - Starfleet Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:23.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经发送数据 请确认是否收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sent you a transmission. Did you receive it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:25.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,开尔文号 请复核这些数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kelvin, can you double- check those readings?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:28.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的重力感应器失灵 非常奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our gravitational sensors are going crazy here. You should see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:29.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像电磁风暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like a lightning storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:31.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你发送的数据看起来似乎不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you've sent us doesn't seem possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:33.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官 我了解 所以我们才发送它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes mam, I understand. That's why we sent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:36.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 报告情况 - 还有20秒进入目视距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Report. - Still outta visual range. 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:40.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,报告瑞博舰长 星际舰队建议采取防御行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alert captain Robau that Starfleet advised to proceed with caution...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,分屏显示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Polarize the view screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:45.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么...克林贡人吗 - 舰长 已经显示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whatever this is... Klingon origin? - Captain, we have visual.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.05,0:01:48.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 重复 会是克林贡吗 - 不是 上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Repeat. Could this be Klingon? - Negative, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:50.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们距离克林贡边境75000英里以外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're 75000 kilometers from the Klingon border.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:52.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 你看...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:56.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:18.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,收到报告 对方武器已经锁定我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a reading. They've locked weapons on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:20.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,红色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:23.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们已被鱼雷锁定 方向320度 二号位 - 准备武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Torpedo locked on us at 320', two! - Arm weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.58,0:02:27.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,执行D- 5回避方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evasive pattern delta 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:31.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们正遭受严重攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're being cut like grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:39.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,发射所有激光炮 报告损害情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire all phasers! Damage report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:42.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,曲速引擎损坏 从没见过这种情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warp drive's been knocked out. Never seen anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:45.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,武器系统中断 主动力剩余38％\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons offline. Main power at 38%.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:48.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们正发射另一颗 - 所有能量集中到前护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're firing another! - All power to forward shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:59.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,救救我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:04.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,失去机动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maneuver has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:05.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,护盾是否启用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are shields even on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:07.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,已经确认17层和13层甲板的伤亡者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decks 17 and 13, we have confirmed casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:10.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,护盾剩余11% 还在下降 10% 9%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11% and dropping. 10%. Shields at 9%.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:12.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有剩余能量转移到前护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All remaining power to forward shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:14.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备撤离用飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare shuttles for evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:19.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:21.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的司令官要求见你们的舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My commander requests the presence of your captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:24.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,以谈判停火条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to negotiate a ceasefire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:27.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,你必须乘坐飞船到我们舰上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will come aboard our ship via shuttlecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:30.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,你若拒绝 那就太蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your refusal would be unwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:45.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:53.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果15分钟内我没有消息 全舰撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't report in 15 minutes evacuate the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:56.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 长官，我们可以... - 在这里我们孤立无援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, we could... - There is no outpost out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:04:00.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,使用自动飞行 然后弃船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use autopilot and get off this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.22,0:04:01.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,明白 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:04.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是舰长了 柯克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're captain now, Mr. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:20.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的心跳加快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His heart rate is elevated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:43.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,看这艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:48.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你熟悉这艘船吗 - 你的司令官是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you familiar with this craft? - Who is your commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:52.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就是他吗 - 我代表尼禄舰长发言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that him? - I will speak for captain Nero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:54.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么请问尼罗舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then ask captain Nero:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:58.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁给他权力肆意攻击联邦星舰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What gives him the right to attack a Federation vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:15.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道斯波克大使在那里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know the location of ambassador Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:20.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道什么斯波克大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm unfamiliar with ambassador Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:24.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在是星历哪年 - 哪一年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is the current star date? - Star date?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:29.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,2233.04\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2233.04.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:32.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们来自哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,已死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:41.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官 他们已经锁定我们的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, they have a lock on our signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:41.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们准备再次开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're launching again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:44.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,B- 6方案 全方位开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo 6 maneuver fire, full spread!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:57.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我下达13号舰长令 全员撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm initiating general order 13, we're evacuating!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:59.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:06.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有舰层注意 我是舰长 立即弃船逃生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All decks, this is the captain speaking, evacuate the ship immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:08.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,迅速前往指定飞船 开始撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your... to the shuttlecraft. Begin evacuating...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:11.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,是乔治的声音 发生什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's George's voice. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:12.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得去逃生艇分娩 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll deliver it in the shuttle. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:27.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 乔治 - 你很好 感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- George. - You're OK, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:30.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,37号医疗逃生艇待命中 你现在过去 可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have medical shuttle 37 standing by. Get to it now. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.29,0:07:30.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:31.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's gonna be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:35.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,照我说的做 去37号逃生艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do exactly as I say, shuttle 37.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:37.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,乔治 快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:40.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们的孩子快出生了 - 我马上到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our baby. It's coming now. - I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:50.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,自动驾驶系统失效 只能人工控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autopilot function has been destroyed. Manual operation only.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:54.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,清理甲板 赶往逃生艇 快 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear those decks now! Get to the shuttles! Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:01.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 越来越厉害了 - 继续呼吸 你会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was a big one! - Just keep breathing. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:04.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 宝宝也一样 对吧 - 宝宝也会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the baby too, right? - And the baby too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:12.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:18.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长呼叫37号逃生艇 我的妻子在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain to shuttle 37. Is my wife on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:21.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的长官 她在 - 我要你们立刻出发 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes sir, she is. - I need you to go now. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:24.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们会等您的 长官 - 不 你们立即离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're waiting on you sir. - No, just go, take off immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:26.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是命令 - 明白 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's an order. - Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我们还不能出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. We're not going yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:33.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:38.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,乔治 逃生艇要离开了 你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, the shuttle's leaving. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:42.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 听我说 我不能赶过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, listen to me. I'm not gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:44.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 这是让你活下去的唯一方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - This is the only way you'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,别留在船上 到我身边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't stay on the ship. Come to me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不打败他们 飞船是逃不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shuttles will never make it if I don't fight them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:53.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,乔治 我不能没有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, I can't do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 现在用力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, I need you to push now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:37.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,系统失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SYSTEMS FAILING
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:44.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,碰撞进程启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}COLLISION COURSE ENGAGED
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:15.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 是个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - It's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:16.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:22.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我说说他 - 他很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me about him. - He's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:26.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,乔治 你应该在这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, you should be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.84,0:10:29.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,撞击警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impact alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:32.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们给他起什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:34.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以起你父亲的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can name him after your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:38.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,泰比里厄斯 你开玩笑吧 不 那太糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiberius, you kiddin' me? No, that's the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:42.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,起你父亲的名字吧 叫他詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's name him after your dad. Let's call him Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:48.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 好 就叫詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim. OK. Jim it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.60,0:10:54.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 你能听到我吗 - 能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sweetheart can you hear me? - I can hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我太爱你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:10:59.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:51.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,《星际迷航》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:04.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,(爱荷华州)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:19.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 那车子可是古董\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, are you out of your mind? That car is an antique.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.61,0:12:21.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你妈不在地球上你就不会被罚了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you can get away with this just because your mother's off planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:25.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在马上滚回家 你住的可是我的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get your ass back home now! You live in my house buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:28.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你住我的房子 开我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You live in my house and that's my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:32.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,你弄伤一道划痕 我就让你尝尝竹笋肉片...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get one scratch on that car and I'm gonna whip your ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.13,0:12:58.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,约翰尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:19.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,先生 请靠边停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Citizen, pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:47.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,有问题吗 警察先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:18.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你叫什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Citizen, what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:22.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我叫詹姆斯·泰比里厄斯·柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is James Tiberius Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:27.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,(瓦肯星)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:41.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,球的体积公式是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the formula for the volume of a sphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.96,0:14:44.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,4/3×π×(R^3)...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4/3 PI times the radius cubed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.06,0:14:47.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,1.26...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1.26...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:57.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,维度是多少...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the dimensionality...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:00.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,维度等于n的对数处以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dimensionality equals the logarithm of n divided by...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:02.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,无排他性及无敌对性...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}non- excludability and non- rivalry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:04.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,4/3×π×(R^3)...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...4/3 PI times the radius...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.87,0:15:08.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,精神上值得称颂 但实际无此义务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is morally praiseworthy but not morally obligatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:13.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:17.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想你已经准备好今天新的侮辱了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I presume you've prepared new insults for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:20.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:31.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是你第35次试图引起我的情绪反映\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your 35th attempt to illicit an emotional response from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:34.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你既非人也非瓦肯人 在宇宙没有立足之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're neither Human nor Vulcan and therefore have no place in this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:37.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,看 他的人眼 那是哀伤 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, his Human eyes. They look sad. Don't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:41.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许需要一些肉体上的刺激才能让你生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps an emotional response requires physical stimulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.59,0:15:44.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲是个叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a traitor you know? Your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:47.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他娶了那个人类娼妓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For marrying her. That Human whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:19.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们说您是叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called you a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:26.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的种族情感深沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emotions run deep within our race.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:28.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,许多方面来说 远比人类更为深邃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In many ways more deeply than in humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:32.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,逻辑能提供给镇定者难得的体验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logic offers a serenity humans seldom experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:38.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,控制住情感 你才不会受它们控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The control of feelings... So that they do not control you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.01,0:16:44.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,您建议我应该彻底成为瓦肯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You suggest that I should be completely Vulcan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:47.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,但你却娶了一个人类女性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet you married a Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:49.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,作为地球大使 我的职责就是观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As ambassador to Earth it is my duty to observe
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.14,0:16:52.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,并理解人类的行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And understand Human behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:57.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,娶了你的母亲...很符合逻辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marrying your mother was... logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:01.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:05.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,你完全能够决定自己的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are fully capable of deciding your own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.91,0:17:11.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 你会选择哪条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question you face is:Which path will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:15.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,有些事只有你自己才能决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is something only you can decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:23.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 过来 让妈看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock. Come here, let me see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:28.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:39.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 你会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no need to be anxious. You'll do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:42.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不担心 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am hardly anxious, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:45.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,"好"的定义太多了 "好"无法令人接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fine has variable definitions, fine is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:49.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.93,0:17:59.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能问个私人问题吗 - 当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- May I ask a personal query? - Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:05.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我应该完成瓦肯的柯里纳训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I choose to complete the Vulcan discipline of Kolinahr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:09.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,去除所有情感吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And purge all emotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:14.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我相信您不会以为 这是针对你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you will not feel it reflects judgment upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:19.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:27.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,一如以往 无论你选择什么 妈妈以你为荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As always, whatever you choose to be, you will have a proud mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:35.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的成绩远胜导师的预期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have surpassed the expectations of your instructors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:39.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的记录完美无瑕 除了一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your final record is flawless. With one exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:43.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我注意到你也申请了联邦星舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see that you have applied to Starfleet as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:46.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,为自己准备多项选择 完全符合逻辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was logical to cultivate more options.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:48.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,合乎逻辑 但不必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logical, but unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:51.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,兹宣布 你已被瓦肯科学研究院接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are hereby accepted to the Vulcan Science Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:54.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 你很优秀 虽有劣势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is truly remarkable Spock that you have achieved so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:56.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,却能获得如此多的成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}despite your disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.85,0:18:59.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,起立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:07.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,议长先生 你能说明你指的什么短处吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you would clarify, minister? To what disadvantage are you referring?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:10.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的人类母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Human mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:17.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,议会 议长们 我必须谢绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Council, ministers, I must decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:19.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,从来没有瓦肯人曾经拒绝进入这所学院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Vulcan has ever declined admission to this Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:23.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,既然我是半人类 您的记录将依旧无瑕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as I am half- human, your record remains untarnished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:26.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 你承诺过会遵循瓦肯方式的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, you have made a commitment to honor the Vulcan way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:28.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你今日为何还要走到议会面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you come before this council today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:31.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了让你的叛逆情绪得到满足吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it to satisfy your emotional need to rebel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:34.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一想表达的情感就是感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only emotion I wish to convey is gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:40.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢议会和议长们对我的关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, ministers, for your consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.07,0:19:43.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,生生不息 繁荣昌盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live long and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:07.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:16.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好 我要一杯星鳗火茶 三杯经典百威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'd like a Clabmin fire tea... 3 Budweiser Classics,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:20.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,两杯卡达西恩日落和...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2 Cardassian sunrises and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:23.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 试试莎休酒 不错的 - 一杯莎休调酒 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Try the Slusho, it's good. - A Slusho mix, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:25.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,作为女人 喝得可真够多的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a lot of drinks for a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:29.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有一杯不加冰的杰克 - 双份 算在我账上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And a shot of Jack, straight up. - Make that two. Her shot's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:32.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,我自己付钱 谢谢 不用你付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her shot's on her. Thanks, but no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:35.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,你彻底拒绝我之前就不想知道我的名字吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you at least wanna know my name before you completely reject me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不问也无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:40.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不问也无所谓 我叫詹姆斯·柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are fine without it. It's Jim, Jim Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.79,0:20:46.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要是不告诉我名字 我只好自己编一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't tell me your name, I'm gonna have to make one up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:49.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我叫乌胡拉 - 乌胡拉 不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Uhura. - Uhura? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.09,0:20:51.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我正想替你起这个名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the name I was gonna make up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:54.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 乌胡拉 姓呢 - 没有姓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uhura what? - Just Uhura.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:55.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们的世界是没有姓的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't have last names in your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,乌胡拉就是我的姓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura is my last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:21:00.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你们的世界是没有名的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well they don't have last names in your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:03.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,借过 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:06.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是学员 学什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're a cadet, your studying. What's your focus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.35,0:21:09.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,外星语言学 你根本不知道这词的意思吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xenolinguistics. You have no idea what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:13.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,外星人语言的研究 形态学 音韵学 句法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The study of alien languages. Morphology, phonology, syntax.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.30,0:21:16.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来你很有语言天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means you've got a talented tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:19.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:21.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,刚才 我还以为你只是个呆头呆脑的乡巴佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a moment there, I thought you were just a dumb- hair colonial
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:23.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,只会找牲口发泄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who has sex with farm animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:26.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,可不只是牲口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not only.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:29.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个土老帽没骚扰你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This townie isn't bothering you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:32.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,骚扰得厉害 不过我应付得来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, beyond belief. But it's nothing I can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:34.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能应付 这算是邀请吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've handled me. That's an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:39.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 你最好识相点 - 别紧张 亲爱的 玩笑而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. You better mind your manners. - Oh relax cupcake, it was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.01,0:21:41.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,乡巴佬 你会数数吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey farm boy, maybe you can't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:43.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有四个人对付你一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are 4 of us and 1 of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:47.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,再多找点人吧 那样才公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So get some more guys and then it'll be an even fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:56.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.43,0:22:28.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, he's had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:35.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,全部出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outside. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.03,0:22:37.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在 - 是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.93,0:22:40.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么... - 我只是喝杯酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What... - I just bought a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.93,0:22:44.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:47.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,你口哨吹得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can whistle really loud, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:51.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,酒保告诉我你是谁的时候我简直不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I couldn't believe it when the bartender told me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:54.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是谁 派克船长 - 你父亲的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who the hell am I, captain Pike? - Your father's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:59.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,能再给我一杯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:01.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我写过关于联邦星舰开尔文号的学术论文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For my dissertation I was assigned USS Kelvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.74,0:23:05.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我欣赏你父亲 他不相信有不可能赢的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something I admired about your dad, he didn't believe in no- win scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:07.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定是经验丰富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure learned his lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:09.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,那取决于你如何定义"胜利"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that depends on how you define winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.48,0:23:11.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在听我说吧 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're here, aren't you? - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.84,0:23:14.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,不加思考直接行动 也是他的天性之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that instinct to leap without looking, that was his nature too...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.94,0:23:17.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认为这正是联邦舰队所失去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in my opinion something Starfleet's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.18,0:23:19.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么和我说这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you talking to me man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:22.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我在你泡妞的时候看了你的档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I looked up your file while you were drooling on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:26.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的能力倾向测验出类拔萃 那问题是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your aptitude tests are off the charts, so what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.95,0:23:29.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想喜欢成为中西部唯一一名天才惯犯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like being the only genius level repeat- offender in the mid- west?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:31.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许我爱得很呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:35.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么是父亲的死让你满足于平淡的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So your dad dies, you can saddle for less than an ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.25,0:23:40.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,还是 你认为自己应得更好的 更为特别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or do you feel that you were meant for something better? Something special?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.95,0:23:45.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 加入星际舰队吧 - 入伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enlist in Starfleet. - Enlist?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.26,0:23:49.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们这个月的招募额肯定是低过头了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys must be way down on your recruiting quarter for the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.49,0:23:51.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你有你父亲一半能力 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're half the man your father was Jim,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.46,0:23:53.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队就能用得上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet could use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:57.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以在四年内成为军官 八年内当上舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can be an officer in 4 years, you can have your own ship in 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:02.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,你明白星际联邦是什么 对吧 这很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand what the Federation is, don't you? It's important,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:04.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,它是一支维护和平及人道主义的舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a peacekeeping and humanitarian armada.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.46,0:24:06.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,说完了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We done?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:09.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.47,0:24:16.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,河边船坞 新人招募艇明早八点离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riverside shipyard. Shuttle for new recruits leaves tomorrow 08:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.47,0:24:24.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲当了12分钟舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father was captain of a starship for 12 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.77,0:24:29.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,他救了800条命 包括你们母子俩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved 800 lives, including your mother's and yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.67,0:24:33.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我谅你也做不到更好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare you to do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.90,0:25:59.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,车够帅啊 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice ride man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.80,0:26:05.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,送给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.01,0:26:08.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,四年吗 我会在三年内做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4 years? I'll do it in 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:26.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.62,0:26:46.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,一直没打听到名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never did get that first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.62,0:26:47.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你需要医生 - 我跟你们说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You need a doctor. - I told you people,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.89,0:26:49.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要医生 该死 我就是医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need a doctor, damn it. I am a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.62,0:26:50.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,你得回到自己座位上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get back to your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:52.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的就在没窗户的盥洗室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had one, in the bathroom with no windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.56,0:26:55.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有惧飞症 我对能上天的东西都怕得要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suffer from aviofobia. That means fear of dying in something that flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.92,0:26:59.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,先生 为了安全请您坐下 否则我得强迫您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, for your own safety, sit down or else I'll make you sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:04.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 谢谢合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fine. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.93,0:27:07.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是派克舰长 我们准备起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is captain Pike, we've been cleared for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.23,0:27:10.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可能会吐在你身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may throw up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.63,0:27:14.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想这里很安全 - 别安慰我了孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think these things are pretty safe. - Don't pander with me kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.03,0:27:17.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,船上有一条小缝 我们的血液将在13秒内沸腾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One tiny crack in the hull and our blood boils in 13 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.53,0:27:20.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,突发一次太阳耀斑 我们将被烤熟在椅子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A solar flare might crop up, cook us in our seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.53,0:27:23.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,等着看你走运地患上安多里安疱疹吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while you're sitting pretty with a case of Andorian shingles,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.43,0:27:26.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,看你双眼流血的时候 还能不能这么镇定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if you're still so relaxed when your eyeballs are bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.83,0:27:30.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,太空就是被黑暗和沉寂掩盖的疾病和危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Space is disease and danger, wrapped in darkness and silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.74,0:27:34.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不想跟你说破 但星舰就是在太空航行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I hate to break this to you, but Starfleet operates in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.64,0:27:36.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 我没别的地儿可去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well... I've got nowhere else to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.64,0:27:39.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,离婚时 前妻抢走了整颗星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ex wife took the whole damn planet in the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.04,0:27:42.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就剩下这把老骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I've got left is my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.54,0:27:52.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯·柯克 - 麦科伊 伦纳德·麦科伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jim Kirk. - McCoy. Leonard McCoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.15,0:28:15.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,三年后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.86,0:28:42.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄舰长 舰桥请您过去 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Nero. You've been requested on the bridge, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.20,0:28:45.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿伊尔说时候到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ayel says it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.46,0:28:53.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我们已经抵达您所计算的坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we've arrived at the coordinates we calculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.16,0:28:56.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,但这里空无一物 您的命令是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing here. What are your orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.17,0:28:57.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.77,0:29:01.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,等那个听任我们家园被毁的人到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wait for the one who allowed our home to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.87,0:29:04.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,正如我们这25年来所做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As we've been doing for 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.37,0:29:08.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 等我们杀了他之后呢 - 杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And once we've killed him? - Kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.37,0:29:12.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会杀了他 我要他看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna kill him. I gonna make him watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:28.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,逮住那只船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capture that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.28,0:29:32.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.38,0:29:37.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在高兴什么 - 不知道你在说啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you so happy? - I do not know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.81,0:29:40.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 我猜你也不知道 - 好啊 姑娘们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I don't suppose you do. - Hello ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.08,0:29:42.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要再做一次测试 - 你开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm taking the test again. - You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.92,0:29:44.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,不开玩笑 明天上午 我要你也来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, tomorrow morning. And I want you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.88,0:29:46.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还有比眼睁睁看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I've got better things to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:48.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,第三次给自己难堪更有价值的事情可做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Than watch you embarrass yourself for the 3rd time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.18,0:29:49.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是医生 詹姆斯 我忙得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a doctor, Jim. I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.58,0:29:51.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,老骨头 从来没人过那个测试 你没有疑问吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, it doesn't bother you that no one's ever passed the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.98,0:29:54.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 那可是小林丸号测试 从来没人能过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, it's Kobayashi Maru. No one passes the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.67,0:29:57.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,也没人去考第二次 更别提第三次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no one goes back for seconds, let alone thirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.99,0:30:00.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还得学习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gotta study.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.29,0:30:02.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你学个屁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Study, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.09,0:30:08.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我想我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, I think I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.69,0:30:11.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好诡异 - 开灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is so weird. - Lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.69,0:30:15.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你刚刚是不是说"好诡异" - 对 我说了 但...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you just say that is so weird. - Yeah, I did, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.13,0:30:16.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不爱我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't love me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.99,0:30:17.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,天 我的室友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, my roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.99,0:30:19.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,可我记得你说过 她整晚都不会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said she was gone for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.27,0:30:21.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,显然不是了 快点 到床底下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously she's not, quick, you gotta... just get under the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.23,0:30:23.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 床底... - 就到床底去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Under... - Look, just get under the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.50,0:30:25.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不能让她看到你在这 - 为啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She can't see you here. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.30,0:30:27.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我向她保证过 不会再把男人带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I promised her I'd stop bringing guys back to the dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.63,0:30:30.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那 你到底带了多少男人... - 快下去 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well how... how many guys have y... - Just d... just down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.40,0:30:34.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.54,0:30:36.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好啊 - 最最奇怪的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. - Strangest thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.70,0:30:38.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在远程传感实验室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in the long range sensor lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.44,0:30:40.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你会呆一整夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I... I thought all night...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.30,0:30:44.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我正追踪太阳系 突然收到紧急求救信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was tracking solar systems and I picked up an emergency transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.90,0:30:46.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.70,0:30:48.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,从一颗克林贡囚星上发出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a Klingon prison planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.80,0:30:50.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.01,0:30:52.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,一支克林贡舰队被毁 47艘舰船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Klingon armada was destroyed, 47 ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.81,0:30:56.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你今晚就不回实验室吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're not going back to the lab tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.61,0:31:01.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 盖尔 他是谁 - 谁是谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gaila, who is he? - Who's who?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.51,0:31:03.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,藏你床底下 张着大嘴呼吸的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mouth- breather hiding under your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.91,0:31:06.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能听到我在呼吸 - 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You could hear me breathing? - You.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.21,0:31:08.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 明天可是大日子 - 你肯定会挂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Big day tomorrow. - You're gonna fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.41,0:31:10.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 盖尔 回见 - 快滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gail, see you around. - Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.01,0:31:11.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是我过了 能告诉我你的名字吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I pass will you tell me your first name?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.51,0:31:12.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,不行 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.51,0:31:16.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你收到求救信号一事非常有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the fact that you picked up a transmission is very impress...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.12,0:31:21.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到从小林丸号舰船发送的遇难信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're receiving a distress signal from the USS Kobayashi Maru.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.12,0:31:23.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,星舰已失去动力 处于困境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship has lost power and is stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.32,0:31:25.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队司令部命令我们前往救援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet command has ordered us to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.42,0:31:31.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,"星际舰队司令部命令我们前往救援"..."舰长"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet command has ordered us to rescue them... captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.72,0:31:33.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,两艘克林贡飞船进入了中立地带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two Klingon vessels have entered the neutral zone...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:35.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,并将武器锁定了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And are locking weapons on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.52,0:31:37.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 没关系 - 没关系吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's okay. - That's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.92,0:31:39.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.62,0:31:41.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说"不用担心"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say don't worry about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.73,0:31:44.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,他压根就没打算认真对待模拟作战吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he not taking the simulation seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:46.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,又有三艘克林贡飞船撤除隐身 瞄准了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three more Klingon war birds decloaking and targeting our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.93,0:31:48.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想 这大概也不成问题吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose this is a problem either?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.87,0:31:50.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们开火了 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're firing, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.13,0:31:51.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,通知医疗部准备迎接受损飞船上的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alert medical bay to prepare to receive...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.96,0:31:54.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有伤员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All crew members from the damaged ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.23,0:31:56.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,被克林贡人包围的情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do you expect us to rescue them...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.23,0:31:58.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,如何拯救他们呢 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we're surrounded by Klingons... captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.73,0:32:01.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,去通知医疗部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alert medical.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.63,0:32:04.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的舰船被击中 护盾剩余60%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ship is being hit. Shields at 60%.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.93,0:32:06.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:09.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要如何 回击吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we, I don't know, fight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.03,0:32:11.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 当然不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.44,0:32:20.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事 搞什么鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.34,0:32:26.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,光子炮 准备对克林贡飞船开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hm. Arm photons. Prepare to fire on the Klingon war birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.54,0:32:28.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 詹姆斯 他们的护盾还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - Jim, their shields are still up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.78,0:32:30.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.94,0:32:35.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 没有了 - 对所有敌舰开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, they're not. - Fire on all enemy ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.74,0:32:38.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,每艘一发光子炮就够了 不必浪费弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One photon each should do let's not waste ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.34,0:32:40.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,锁定目标 瞄准所有飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target locked an acquired on all war birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:42.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.45,0:32:47.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有舰船都已摧毁 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All ships destroyed, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.75,0:32:49.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,开始拯救被困人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin rescue of the stranded crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.05,0:32:52.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们设法摧毁了所有敌舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we've managed to eliminate all enemy ships,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.35,0:32:54.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,船上无人受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one on board was injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.35,0:33:00.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,对小林丸号船员的成功救援正在进行之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the successful rescue of the Kobayashi Maru crew is under way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.15,0:33:07.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,那小鬼怎么能通过你的测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did that kid beat your test?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.65,0:33:12.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.46,0:33:15.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,召开这次会议 是为了解决一件麻烦事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This session has been called to resolve a troubling matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.96,0:33:18.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·T·柯克 走上前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James T. Kirk, step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.96,0:33:22.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克学员 有证据被呈交委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cadet Kirk, evidence has been submitted to this council,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.76,0:33:25.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,指出你违反了星际舰队章程17.43规章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suggesting that you violated the ethical code of conduct
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.70,0:33:29.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,所制定的行动守则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pursuing to regulation 17.43 of the Starfleet code.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.16,0:33:32.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我们开始之前 你有想说的话吗 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything you care to say before we begin, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.26,0:33:38.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,有 我想我有权面对我的控告人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I believe I have the right to face my accuser directly?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.27,0:33:44.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,请站上前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step forward please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.57,0:33:48.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克指挥官 我们最杰出的毕业生之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is commander Spock. He is one of our most distinguished graduates.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.77,0:33:52.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,在过去的四年里 他负责编程小林丸号测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's programmed the Kobayashi Maru exam for the last 4 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.47,0:33:56.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.27,0:33:59.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克学员 你设法在程序代码中...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cadet Kirk, you somehow managed to install and activate a subroutine...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.27,0:34:02.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,安插了一个子程序 改变了测试的条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the programming code, thereby changing the conditions of the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.67,0:34:07.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想说的是 - 用校园行话来说 你作弊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your point being? - In academic vernacular. You cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.88,0:34:13.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我问个谁都知道答案的问题吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you something I think we all know the answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.48,0:34:17.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,测试本身就是作弊吧 你根本没打算让人赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The test itself is a cheat, isn't it? You programmed it to be unwinnable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.88,0:34:20.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的论点排除了毫无赢面出现的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your argument precludes the ability of a no- win scenario?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.58,0:34:22.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信毫无赢面的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe in no- win scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.78,0:34:23.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你不仅仅违反了规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then not only did you violate the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.98,0:34:26.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且根本就没弄懂关键点何在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you also failed to understand the principle lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.38,0:34:27.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就给我点启发吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.88,0:34:30.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,你应该比别人更清楚 柯克学员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You of all people should know, cadet Kirk,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.09,0:34:32.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长无法逃脱一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A captain cannot cheat death.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.19,0:34:38.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 就我一个人吗 - 你父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I of all people? - Your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.09,0:34:40.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,乔治·柯克中尉接过舰长一职之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lt. George Kirk assumed command of his vessel...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.29,0:34:41.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,随即阵亡 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before being killed in action, did he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.89,0:34:43.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想你大概很不高兴我通过了你的测试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you like the fact that I beat your test.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.89,0:34:46.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,此外 你未能明白这一测试的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Further more you have failed to define the purpose of the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.29,0:34:49.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 再给我点启发吧 - 其目的是为了体验恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enlighten me again. - The purpose to experience fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.49,0:34:53.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,在死亡已无可避免时的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear in the face of certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.99,0:34:56.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,在接受恐惧的同时 控制住自己 管理好船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To accept that fear and maintain control of oneself and one's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.99,0:35:00.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是星际舰队每一位舰长都应具备的素质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a quality expected in every Starfleet captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.20,0:35:04.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.90,0:35:13.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到瓦肯星发来的求救信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've received a distress call from Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.60,0:35:16.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的主要战舰均集结在劳伦星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With our primary fleet engaged in the Laurentian system,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.60,0:35:20.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在此命令所有学员马上到一号机库报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hereby order all cadets to report to hangar 1 immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.20,0:35:21.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,解散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:30.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个尖耳杂种是谁 - 我不认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who was that pointy-eared bastard? - I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.50,0:35:32.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过我喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.81,0:35:39.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,巴瑞瑟 联邦星舰法拉古特号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bracer, USS Farragut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.41,0:35:40.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,麦考伊 联邦星舰进取号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCoy, USS Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.00,0:35:42.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,麦克格拉斯 联邦星舰沃尔科特号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McGrath, USS Walcott.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.81,0:35:44.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴德 联邦星舰胡德号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spader, USS Hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.31,0:35:46.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到星际舰队 祝各位好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Starfleet. Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.51,0:35:51.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,他没叫到我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't call my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.21,0:35:56.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,指挥官 长官 你没叫我的名字 柯克 詹姆斯·T\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, sir, you didn't call my name, Kirk, James T.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.01,0:35:59.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克 你被停学了 意味着在校委会裁决之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk, you're on academic suspension, that means you're grounded
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.41,0:36:01.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,你必须留在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until the academy board rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.22,0:36:07.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 校委会的裁决会偏向你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, the board will rule in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.12,0:36:09.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,很有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.32,0:36:13.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着 詹姆斯 我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look Jim, I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.32,0:36:16.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的 你去吧 小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, go. Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.62,0:36:26.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 借过 - 嗯 嗯 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Yeah. Yeah. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.63,0:36:32.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.33,0:36:36.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.03,0:36:37.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,乌胡拉 联邦星舰法拉古特号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura, USS Farragut.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.57,0:36:39.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,普特拉夫斯基 联邦星舰心宿二星号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Petrovsky, USS Antares.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.63,0:36:42.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,马上各就各位 祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to your stations and good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.23,0:36:48.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 老骨头 我们去哪啊 - 你马上就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bones, where are we going? - You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.13,0:36:51.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 指挥官 能问一句么 - 什么事 中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Commander, a word? - Yes, lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.73,0:36:54.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我难道不是您最好的学生之一吗 - 你当然是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was I not one of your top students? - Indeed you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.13,0:36:56.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我难道不是曾经多次表露出...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And did I not on multiple occasions demonstrate...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.94,0:36:59.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我卓越的听觉能力 并且 恕我引用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an exceptional oral sensitivity, and I quote...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.14,0:37:02.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,"在子空间数据传输测验中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"An unparalleled ability to identify sonic anomalies...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.04,0:37:03.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,可分辨出音波异常的卓绝能力"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In subspace transmission tests"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.87,0:37:05.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,一直都是 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consistently, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.34,0:37:07.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,您十分明白 我最大的希望...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while you were well aware that I'm qualified...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.14,0:37:08.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是能在进取号星舰上服役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And desire to serve on the USS Enterprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.87,0:37:10.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,可您竟然分配我到法拉古特号上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm assigned to the Farragut?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.94,0:37:14.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了避免表现出偏爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an attempt to avoid the appearance of favoritism.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.14,0:37:16.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要去进取号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm assigned to the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.44,0:37:22.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你是去进取号 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, I believe you are. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.74,0:37:26.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么 - 帮你的忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - I'm doing you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.05,0:37:29.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能把你留在那里可怜兮兮的 坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn just leave you there looking all pathetic. Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.05,0:37:30.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,坐下 我要给你打一针抗泥蚤...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me give you a vaccine against viral infection...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.88,0:37:33.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,病毒感染的疫苗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the Ovaran mud flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.25,0:37:36.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛 - 为了让你出现症状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What for? - To give you the symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.45,0:37:37.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.55,0:37:39.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的左眼很快会失去视力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna start to lose vision in your left eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.45,0:37:40.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.85,0:37:43.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后你会出现严重的头疼 大量流汗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and you're gonna get a really bad headache and flop sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.85,0:37:46.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你管这叫帮忙 - 对啊 你欠我一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You call this a favor? - Yeah, you owe me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.35,0:37:53.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克 詹姆斯·T 他没被分派到进取号上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk, James T. He is not cleared for duty aboard the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.06,0:37:55.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,医务条例规定 治疗与运送一名病人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medical code states the treatment and transport of a patient is...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.93,0:37:58.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,必须听从其主治医生的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be determined at the discretion of his attending physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.86,0:38:01.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,也就是我 所以我要带柯克先生上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is me. So I'm taking Mr. Kirk aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.66,0:38:04.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,或者 你宁愿去向派克舰长解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you would you like to explain to captain Pike...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.26,0:38:05.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,为何进取号曲速冲向危机时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why Enterprise warped into a crisis...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.99,0:38:08.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰上竟少了一名它的主要医官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without one of its senior medical officers?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.46,0:38:12.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 上船吧 - 上船 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As you were. - As you were. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.47,0:38:32.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可能会吐你身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might throw up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.37,0:38:34.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你真该看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, you've gotta look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.97,0:38:37.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 看 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jim, look. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.09,0:39:36.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得替你换件衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get you changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.29,0:39:38.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不太对劲 好像尿裤子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel right. I feel like I'm leaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.23,0:39:40.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 尖耳杂种在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, it's that pointy- eared bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.10,0:40:00.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯波克先生 - 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Spock. - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.90,0:40:03.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 轮机部报告 已做好起飞准备 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Engineering reports ready for launch. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.90,0:40:06.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 我们最新旗舰的处女航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, the maiden voyage of our newest flagship
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.54,0:40:09.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,值得比我们今天提供的更加盛大的仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deserves more pompon circumstance that we can afford today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:13.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,她的洗礼仪式将是对我们顺利返航的奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The christening will just have to be our reward for a safe return.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.20,0:40:14.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.71,0:40:17.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,各舰层 我是派克舰长 准备立即出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All decks, this is Captain Pike. Prepare for immediate departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.11,0:40:18.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,舵手 推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helm, thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.41,0:40:21.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,系具已收回 舰长 港口控制室报告准备完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...retracted, captain, dock control reports ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.01,0:40:24.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,推进器点火 离开太空港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thrusters fired. Separating from space dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.01,0:40:36.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,已离开太空港 舰长 所有舰船准备曲速前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fleet's cleared space dock, captain. All ships ready for warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.31,0:40:38.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 设定到瓦肯星的航线 - 是 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Set course for Vulcan. - Aye-aye, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.51,0:40:41.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,航线已设定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Course laid in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.71,0:40:44.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,最大曲速 冲吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maximum warp. Punch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.12,0:41:04.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 中尉 麦肯纳舵手在哪 - 他患上肺虫了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lieutenant, where's helmsmen McKenna? - He has lung worms sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.16,0:41:06.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,没法到位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't report to his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.12,0:41:09.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是苏鲁田光 - 你是个飞行员吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm Hikaru Sulu. - And you are a pilot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.82,0:41:14.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,毋庸置疑 长官 我...不太确定出了什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very much so, sir. I'm... I'm not sure what's wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.33,0:41:16.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,制动系统还开着么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the parking brake on?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.63,0:41:17.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.73,0:41:18.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会查出来的 只是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured it out, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.73,0:41:21.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,你松开外层惯性抑制器了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you disengaged the external inertial dampener?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.03,0:41:28.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备曲速前进 长官 - 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready for warp, sir. - Let's punch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.63,0:41:37.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们在哪 - 医疗部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are we? - Medical bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.44,0:41:39.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这可不值得 - 苦其体肤对灵魂有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This isn't worth it. - A little suffering's good for the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.47,0:41:40.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.24,0:41:43.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我嘴巴痒痒 这正常吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mouth is itchy. Is that normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.25,0:41:44.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,那些症状不会持续很久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, those symptoms won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.84,0:41:46.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我再给你一针中效镇静剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to give you a mild sedative.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.75,0:41:47.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望不认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I wish I didn't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.97,0:41:49.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,别幼稚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be such an infant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.24,0:41:53.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,这到底要多久...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long is it supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.34,0:41:55.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.24,0:41:57.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,引擎已至最大曲速 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engines at maximum warp captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.54,0:41:59.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯神童 你叫什么 柴可 切泼夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Russian whiz kid, what's your name? Cheikov? Chirpov?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.94,0:42:03.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 切科夫少尉 帕维尔·安德烈 长官 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ensign Chekov, Pavel Andrejevic, sir. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.14,0:42:06.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,切科夫 帕维尔·安德烈 开始全舰任务广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chekov, Pavel Andrejevic, begin ship wide mission broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.14,0:42:08.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官 乐意之至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.55,0:42:12.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,少尉级授权码 9- 5- Wictor- Wictor- 2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ensign authorization code 95 Wictor Wictor 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.45,0:42:14.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,授权码无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Authorization not recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.65,0:42:21.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,少尉级授权码 9- 5- Victor- Victor- 2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ensign authorization code 95 Victor Victor 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.55,0:42:23.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,成功进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Access granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.55,0:42:26.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,请各位注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have your attention please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.65,0:42:32.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,22:00 遥感勘测仪在中立地带发现异常现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 22:00, telemetry detected an anomaly in the neutral zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.15,0:42:35.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,看着像是在宇宙间发生的雷暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What appeared to be a lightning storm in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.85,0:42:40.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,不久后 舰队收到瓦肯议会发来的求救信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon after, Starfleet received a distress signal from the Vulcan high command
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.76,0:42:44.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,称他们的星球目前地壳活动剧烈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That their planet was experiencing seismic activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.66,0:42:48.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的使命 就是评估瓦肯星的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our mission is to assess the condition of Vulcan
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.56,0:42:52.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,在必要之时帮助其撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And assist in evacuations if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.56,0:42:57.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,三分钟内 我们将到达瓦肯星 谢谢您的收听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should be arriving at Vulcan within 3 minutes. Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.86,0:43:00.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,雷暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lightning storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.76,0:43:03.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你醒了 感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah Jim, you're awake. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.87,0:43:07.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good God, man! - What? Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.27,0:43:12.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这他妈怎么回事 - 疫苗过敏 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell's this? - A reaction to the vaccine. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.57,0:43:15.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,夏蓓尔护士 我需要50毫升可的松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nurse Chapel, I need 50cc of cortisone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.17,0:43:16.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.87,0:43:22.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,请...像是在宇宙间发生的雷暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I... Appeared to be a lightning storm in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.27,0:43:24.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把船停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've gotta stop the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.57,0:43:27.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我不是开玩笑 你得把心率降下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim. I'm not kidding. You need to keep your heart rate down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.37,0:43:30.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 标示乘务员乌胡拉所在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, locate crew member Uhura.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.17,0:43:32.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,自从毕业后我还没见过这么糟糕的反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen a reaction this severe since medical school.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.76,0:43:35.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们正驶向陷阱 - 该死 詹姆斯 给我站好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're flying into a trap! - Damn it, Jim! Stand still.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.88,0:43:38.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.08,0:43:49.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 乌胡拉 乌胡拉... - 柯克 你在这做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uhura, Uhura... - Kirk. What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.29,0:43:51.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,从克林贡囚星发来的信号 具体说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transmission from the Klingon prison planet, what exactly did it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:53.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 你的手怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God, what's wrong with your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.48,0:43:55.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,是谁攻击了克林贡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is responsible for the Klingon attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.78,0:43:58.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那舰船... - 那舰船怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And was the ship Romu... - Was the ship what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.28,0:44:00.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的嘴巴怎么了 - 舌头麻痹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's happening to my mouth? - You got numb tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.32,0:44:02.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 舌头麻痹 - 我能解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Numb tongue?! - I can fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.59,0:44:04.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那舰船怎么了 - 罗慕伦人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was the ship what? - Romulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.62,0:44:06.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 罗慕伦人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Romulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.19,0:44:07.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗慕伦人 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Romulan? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.29,0:44:09.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.80,0:44:47.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄舰长 七艘联邦星舰飞过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prod Nero seven Federation ships are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.40,0:44:50.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 - 发生什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jim! - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.89,0:44:52.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 回来 - 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jim, come back. - Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.70,0:44:54.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,派克舰长 我们必须停船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Pike, sir, we have to stop the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.30,0:44:56.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克 你是怎么登上进取号的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk, how the hell did you get on board the Enterprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.81,0:44:58.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 这家伙正在被疫苗的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, this man is under the influence of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.61,0:45:00.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 强烈过敏反应所影响 - 老骨头 拜...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Severe reaction to a vaccine. - Bones, plea...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.21,0:45:01.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,他现在完全是胡言乱语...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's completely delusional...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.31,0:45:03.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,瓦肯星正在经历的并非自然灾害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulcan is not a experiencing a natural disaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.51,0:45:04.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是被罗慕伦人攻击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's being attacked by Romulans.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.91,0:45:08.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗慕伦人 柯克 你今天得到的关注够多了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romulans? Cadet Kirk, I think you've had enough attention for one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.31,0:45:10.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,麦考伊 带他回医疗部去 我们一会儿再谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCoy, take him back to medical. We'll have words later.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.84,0:45:12.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 舰长 - 长官 与此相同的异常现象...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye captain. - Sir, that same anomaly...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.71,0:45:14.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克先生无权登上此舰 舰长...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kirk is not cleared to be aboard this vessel, captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.81,0:45:16.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 你的辩论很了不起...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I get it, you're a great...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.21,0:45:17.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很乐意再来一次...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to do it again with you soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.81,0:45:19.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以送走这学员... - 你试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can remove the cadet... - Try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.40,0:45:21.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,这名学员正试图拯救整个舰桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cadet is trying to save the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.01,0:45:24.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,就要求肩负使命的星舰停止曲速飞行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By recommending a full stop mid- warp doing a rescue mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.01,0:45:25.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,这不是救援任务 听我说 这是攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a rescue mission. Listen to me. It's an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.75,0:45:28.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,基于何种理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Based on what facts?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.42,0:45:32.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,与此相同的异常现象 在宇宙空间中的雷暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That same anomaly, a lightning storm in space
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.52,0:45:34.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天见到的 我出生那天也发生过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That we saw today, also occurred on the day of my birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.52,0:45:37.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,在一艘罗慕伦飞船攻击星舰开尔文号之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before a Romulan ship attacked the USS Kelvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.52,0:45:39.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,您知道的 长官 我看过您的论文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that, sir. I've read your dissertation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.62,0:45:42.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,那艘拥有令人畏惧的先进武器的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ship, which had formidable and advanced weaponry...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.22,0:45:44.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,之后没再有人见过或听说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was never seen or heard from again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.12,0:45:46.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,开尔文号攻击战发生在克林贡星区边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Kelvin attacked a place on the edge of Klingon space.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.16,0:45:48.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚23:00 那里发生了一次战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And at 23:00 last night there was an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.82,0:45:52.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,有47艘克林贡飞船被罗慕伦人摧毁 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}47 Klingon war birds destroyed by Romulans, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.72,0:45:55.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,据报告罗慕伦人乘坐的是一艘庞大的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was reported that the Romulans were in one ship, one massive ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.86,0:45:58.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这次克林贡人被袭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know of this Klingon attack how?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.73,0:46:04.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官 是我截获并翻译了那条信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I intercepted and translated the message myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.73,0:46:07.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 柯克的报告准确无误 - 我们正飞向圈套 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kirk's report is accurate. - We're warping into a trap, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.46,0:46:10.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗慕伦人正等着我们 我可以保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Romulans are waiting for us. I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.23,0:46:13.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,该学员的逻辑分析很有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cadet's logic is sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.93,0:46:16.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,乌胡拉中尉在外星语言学的造诣无人能及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Lt. Uhura's is unmatched in xenolinguistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.17,0:46:17.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该明智地接受她的推论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We would be wise to accept her conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.83,0:46:20.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,扫描瓦肯星域 彻查有无罗慕伦人的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scan Vulcan space. Check for any transmissions in Romulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.93,0:46:24.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我不确定能否辨别罗慕伦语和瓦肯语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I'm not sure I can distinguish the Romulan language from Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.54,0:46:26.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你呢 你懂罗慕伦语吗 学员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you? Do you speak Romulan, cadet?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.47,0:46:28.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,乌胡拉 三种方言都懂 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura. All 3 dialects, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.14,0:46:31.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 乌胡拉 去接替中尉 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uhura, relieve the lieutenant. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.44,0:46:32.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,汉妮蒂 呼叫联邦星舰杜鲁门号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hannity, hail the USS Truman.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.94,0:46:35.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他舰船已停止曲速飞行且抵达瓦肯星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the other ships are out of warp sir and have arrived at Vulcan,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.57,0:46:37.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我们似乎失去了所有联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we seem to have lost all contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.84,0:46:42.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我在没有收到罗慕伦人或其他信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I pick up no Romulan transmission or transmission of any kind in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.44,0:46:45.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,那因为他们被攻击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because they're being attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.14,0:46:51.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,升起护盾 红色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields up. Red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.15,0:46:55.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,五秒内抵达瓦肯星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrival at Vulcan in 5 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.75,0:46:59.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,四 三 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4... 3... 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.35,0:47:02.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 紧急闪避 - 遵命 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Emergency evasives. - Running, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.45,0:47:12.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 受损情况报告 - 偏针仪护盾正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damage report. - Deflector shields are holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.09,0:47:14.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有单位 奥尔森轮机长 报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All stations. Engineering, Olson, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.16,0:47:26.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,整体翻转 右舷转向90度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full reverse. Come about starboard, 90'
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.06,0:47:28.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁 降到它们底下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop us down underneath them, Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.87,0:47:50.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 长官 还有一艘联邦星舰 - 照样毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, there's another Federation ship. - Destroy it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.17,0:47:51.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,发射鱼雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.17,0:47:52.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 他们正用鱼雷锁定我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, they're locking torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.37,0:47:55.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,将引擎的所有备用能源都输送给前方护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Divert auxiliary power from port nossel to forward shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.67,0:48:05.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 苏鲁 报告情况 - 护盾32%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sulu, status report. - Shields at 32%.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.27,0:48:07.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,对方武器太强大 长官 我们无法再承受一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their weapons are powerful, sir. We can't take another hit like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.67,0:48:09.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我接星际舰队指挥部 - 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get me Starfleet command. - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.37,0:48:12.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗慕伦飞船将某种高能脉冲装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Romulan ship has lowered some kind of high energy pulse device
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.27,0:48:13.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,刺入瓦肯星的大气层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the Vulcan atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.47,0:48:16.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,它发出的讯号堵塞了我们的通信以及传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's signal appears to be blocking our communications and transporter abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.38,0:48:19.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有能量集中到前护盾 所有武器准备开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All power to forward shields. Prepare to fire all weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.38,0:48:24.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,武器准备完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.88,0:48:26.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.48,0:48:29.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 船身 把它放大 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gohol, magnify! - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.88,0:48:36.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官 他们致电过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we're being hailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.08,0:48:39.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.18,0:48:42.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是克里斯托弗·派克舰长 您是哪位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the captain Christopher Pike. To whom am I speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.18,0:48:45.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗 我是尼禄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi Christopher. I am Nero.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.39,0:48:47.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你已经向星际联邦宣战 如果撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've declared war against the Federation. Withdraw...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.99,0:48:49.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还能同意在中立地点安排一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll agree to arrange a conference...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.59,0:48:51.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,与罗慕伦高层之间的会谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Romulan leadership at a neutral location.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.29,0:48:55.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我并不代表罗慕伦帝国 我们彼此独立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not speak for the Empire. We stand apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.89,0:49:00.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像你们那位瓦肯船员 不是么 斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As does your Vulcan crew member. Isn't that right, Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.29,0:49:06.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧 我相信你我并不相识吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon me, I do not believe that you and I are acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.29,0:49:07.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们不认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.89,0:49:09.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,还没认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.79,0:49:13.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 有样东西我要让你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, there's something I would like you to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.60,0:49:18.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,派克舰长 你们的传送装置已经无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Pike, your transporter has been disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.80,0:49:22.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也看到了其他星舰的下场 你已别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, by the rest of the armada, you have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.20,0:49:27.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,你必须亲自驾驶飞船到纳拉达号进行谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will man a shuttle. Come aboard the Narada for negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.90,0:49:30.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.50,0:49:40.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会杀了你 你知道的 - 你将不可能存活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They'll kill you, you know that. - Your survival is unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.51,0:49:41.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 外交手段毫无用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we gain nothing by diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.99,0:49:43.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,到那艘飞船上去是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going over to that ship is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.61,0:49:45.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也同意 你应该重新思考战略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I too agree. You should rethink your strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.31,0:49:47.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.71,0:49:51.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要接受过高级近身搏击训练的士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need officers who've been trained in advanced hand to hand combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.21,0:49:53.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我受过训 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have training, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.61,0:49:55.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.51,0:49:57.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克 你一起来 反正你也不该呆在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk, you too. You're not supposed to be here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.91,0:50:00.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 切科夫 你负责掌舵 - 遵命 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chekov, you have the con. - Aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.62,0:50:23.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备好红色物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare the red matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.22,0:50:27.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.84,0:51:06.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有传送器 我们没法将自己传离飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without transporters we can't beam off the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.92,0:51:09.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法救援瓦肯人 我们完不成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't assist Vulcan. We can't do our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.34,0:51:14.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克 苏鲁 和奥尔森将从飞船进行太空跳伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kirk, Mr. Sulu and engineer Olson will space- jump from the shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.44,0:51:17.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们要降落到他们伸进大气的那台机器上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will land on that machine they've lowered into the atmosphere...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.24,0:51:20.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,它扰乱了我们的传输 你们进去把它关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's scrambling our gear, you'll get inside, you'll disable it...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.44,0:51:22.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后你们就能被传送回船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'll beam back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.04,0:51:25.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克先生 进取号现在由你指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Spock, I'm leaving you in command of the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.54,0:51:28.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,传送与通信功能一旦恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we have transport capability and communication back up
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.14,0:51:31.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,你马上联系星际舰队 报告这里的一切情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll contact Starfleet and report what the hell's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.14,0:51:33.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果其他人都失败了 迅速撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if all else fails, fall back...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.24,0:51:35.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,与在劳伦星系的舰队会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And rendezvous with the fleet in the Laurentian system.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.28,0:51:36.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克 我现在升你为大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk, I'm promoting you to first officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.85,0:51:38.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.05,0:51:41.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 但我无法理解人类玩笑话的复杂性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I apologize. The complexities of Human pranks escape me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.35,0:51:43.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 这不是玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a prank, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.45,0:51:46.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也不是舰长了 你才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am not the captain, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.15,0:51:49.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.05,0:51:53.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我们毁掉那钻头后 你怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, after we knock out that drill, what happens to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.85,0:51:55.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想 你可能得过来接我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you have to come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.05,0:51:59.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心驾驶这船 斯波克 她还是崭新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful with the ship, Spock. She's brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.96,0:52:12.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 普利医生 请报告 - 我是麦考伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dr. Puri, report. - It's McCoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.54,0:52:15.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,普利医生在第六层甲板 他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Puri was on deck 6. He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.36,0:52:19.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你刚刚接过了他主任医官的职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you have just inherited his responsibility as chief medical officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.26,0:52:21.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 说点我不知道的行不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, tell me something I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.36,0:52:29.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,89号飞船 这里是联邦星舰进取号 你可以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shuttle 89, USS Enterprise, you are clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.37,0:52:33.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 炸药你带着吧 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've got the charges, right? - Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.47,0:52:36.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,都等不及狠踹那些罗慕伦人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't wait to kick some Romulan ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.37,0:52:39.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.97,0:52:59.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你接受过哪种搏击训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what kinda combat training do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.98,0:53:02.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,击剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.48,0:53:06.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备跳伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pre- jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.08,0:53:13.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,飞船指挥官 你们已离开进取号领空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shuttle commander, you are clear from USS Enterprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.28,0:53:22.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,先生们 我们就要到达跳伞区域了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, we're approaching the drop zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.38,0:53:25.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们只有一次机会降落到平台上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have one shot to land on that platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.28,0:53:28.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能有所防备 所以尽量晚点开降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They may have defenses, so pull your chute as late as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.69,0:53:32.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3... 2... 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.29,0:53:35.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,记住 进取号没法把你们传送回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, the Enterprise won't be able to beam you back...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.58,0:53:37.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们先关掉那钻头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until you've turned off that drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.39,0:53:41.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.90,0:54:04.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,外勤小队正在进入大气层 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Away team is entering the atmosphere, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.80,0:54:06.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,两万米高空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20000 m.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.91,0:54:33.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,正在接近位于5800米处的平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching the platform at 5800 m.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.21,0:54:37.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克呼叫进取号 目标距离 5000米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk to Enterprise. Distance to target 5000 m.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.91,0:54:41.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,离平台还有4600米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4600 m from the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.91,0:54:43.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,离目标还剩4100米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4100 m to target.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.31,0:54:46.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,4000米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4000 m.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.91,0:54:49.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,3000米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3000 m.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.31,0:54:52.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,2000米 打开降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2000 m. Pull the chute.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.02,0:55:00.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 2000米 - 快点 打开降落伞 奥尔森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 2000 m. - Pull your chute, Olson.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.62,0:55:02.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 还不行 还不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not yet. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.52,0:55:05.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 1500米 - 打开降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 1500 m. - Open the chute!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.02,0:55:09.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 奥尔森 打开你的降落伞 - 1000米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Olson, pull your chute! - 1000 m.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.43,0:55:23.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥尔森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olson!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.23,0:55:25.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥尔森死了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olson is gone, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.53,0:55:47.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克着陆了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk has landed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.98,0:57:52.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,手给我 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.78,0:58:02.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹在奥尔森那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olson had the charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.58,0:58:04.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.88,0:58:08.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么办 - 这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do we do? - This.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.89,0:58:24.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,干扰信号消失 通信功能已经恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The jamming signal's gone. Transport abilities are reestablished.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.39,0:58:26.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,传送控制中心恢复了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transporter control is reengaged sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.39,0:58:29.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,启动传感器 我要知道他们对星球做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check all gravitational sensors. I wanna know what they were doing to the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.43,0:58:32.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 指挥官 舰长 抱歉 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Commander. Captain. Sorry, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.79,0:58:40.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,钻头被破坏 长官 不过我们已经钻至地核\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The drill's been sabotaged sir but we have reached the planet's core.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.30,0:58:42.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,发射红色物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch red matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.30,0:58:59.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克呼叫进取号 他们往星球上发射了东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk to Enterprise. They just launched something at the planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.75,0:59:01.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,直接进入他们刚钻的洞里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through the hole they just drilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.50,0:59:04.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 听到了吗 进取号 - 听到了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you copy Enterprise? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.00,0:59:08.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 引力传感器超过读数范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, gravitational sensors are off the scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.21,0:59:13.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的计算正确 他们正制造一个奇异点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my calculations are correct, they're creating a singularity...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.01,0:59:16.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,足以吞噬整个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will consume the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.91,0:59:21.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们在瓦肯星中心制造了一个黑洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're creating a black hole at the center of Vulcan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.51,0:59:23.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:25.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,星球还剩多少时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long does the planet have?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.21,0:59:28.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,几分钟 长官 几分钟而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minutes, sir. Minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.51,0:59:31.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,向瓦肯议会中心发出警报 撤离整个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alert Vulcan command center to signal a planet wide evacuation...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.92,0:59:33.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,用所有频道 所有频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All channels, all frequencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.01,0:59:34.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯波克 等等 - 保持标准轨道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spock, wait. - Maintain standard orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.25,0:59:36.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 你去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.12,0:59:37.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,去撤离瓦肯长老会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To evacuate the Vulcan High Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.92,0:59:39.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们的职责是保护我们的历史文化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their task is to protect our cultural history,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.42,0:59:41.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的父母也在其中 - 你不能把他们传上来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My parents will be among them. - Can't you beam them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.55,0:59:44.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,那不可能 他们呆在卡催克方舟里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is impossible. They will be in the Katric ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.12,0:59:45.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得亲自去接他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must get them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.72,0:59:49.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 切科夫 你负责掌舵 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chekov, you have the con. - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.62,0:59:54.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克呼叫进取号 把我们传出这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk to Enterprise. Beam us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.26,0:59:56.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,请准备 正在锁定你们的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by, locking on your signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.52,0:59:59.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 收起钻头 我们走吧 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Retract the drill. Let's move out - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.02,1:00:00.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,收起钻头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fold up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.23,1:00:06.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没法跟踪他们 别动 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't lock on to them. Don't move. Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.23,1:00:08.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sulu!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.43,1:00:17.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sulu!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.63,1:00:21.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.43,1:00:25.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我抓住你了 快打开我的降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gotcha. Now pull my chute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.04,1:00:36.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克呼叫进取号 我们正在下落 没有降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk to Enterprise! We're falling without a chute!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.34,1:00:37.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,快传我们上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beam us up!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.40,1:00:39.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我追踪不上你们的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I can't lock on to your signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.37,1:00:41.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 传我们上去 - 你们移动太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Beam us up! - You're moving too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.24,1:00:44.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能做到 我能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do that. I can do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.24,1:00:46.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你掌舵 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take the con. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.04,1:00:47.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,黑洞正在扩张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The black hole's expanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.64,1:00:50.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,不马上离开 我们就无法到达最小安全距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't reach minimum safe distance if we don't leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.74,1:00:54.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,让开 让开 我能做到 我能做到 让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move. Move... I can do that. I can do that. Move. Move...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.64,1:00:59.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我人工控制 我能追踪到他们 - 传我们上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me manual control, I can lock on. - Beam us up!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.85,1:01:04.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 进取号 你们在干嘛 - 坚持住 坚持住 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enterprise, where are you? - Hold on. Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.75,1:01:09.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在 现在 就现在 快啊 现在 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now! Now! Now! Do it now! Now! Now! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.15,1:01:15.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 坚持住 修正重力牵引作用 然后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. Hold on. Compensating gravitational pull. Aaand...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.45,1:01:19.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.16,1:01:32.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.16,1:01:36.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,清空发射台 我要到地面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear the pad. I'm beaming to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.96,1:01:39.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The surface of what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.26,1:01:43.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你要下去 疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you're going down there? Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.06,1:01:45.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯波克 你不能那么做 - 启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spock, you can't do that. - Energize.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.70,1:02:25.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.91,1:02:28.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,星球仅剩几秒钟 我们必须离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The planet has only seconds left, we must evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.98,1:02:31.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,母亲 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.28,1:02:54.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克呼叫进取号 传我们上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock to Enterprise. Get us out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.38,1:02:57.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,正在锁定 别动 呆在原地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locking on to you. Don't move. Stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.18,1:03:08.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,传送准备 五 四 三 二...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transport in 5... 4... 3... 2...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.08,1:03:14.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 我要失去她了 我要失去她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mother! - I'm losing her! I'm losing her!...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.58,1:03:17.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我失去她了 我找不回她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lost her! I've lost her.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.19,1:04:17.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,启动舰长日志 星际历2258.42\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Acting captain's log, star date 2258.42.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.60,1:04:21.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,派克舰长未能给我们发来只字片语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have had no word from captain Pike.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.50,1:04:24.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,因此我确定他已成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have therefore classified him a hostage...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.16,1:04:26.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,名为尼禄之战犯的人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the war criminal known as Nero...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.10,1:04:32.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄 他毁了我的母星及其六十亿居民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nero, who has destroyed my home planet and most of its 6 billion inhabitants.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.50,1:04:35.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我们文化之精髓 因守护它的长老们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While the essence of our culture has been saved...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.71,1:04:38.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,登上这艘飞船而得以保存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the elders who now reside upon this ship...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.50,1:04:44.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我估计幸存者不会超过一万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I estimate no more than 10000 have survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.70,1:04:51.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我现在成了濒危物种的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am now a member of an endangered species.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.61,1:05:20.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.31,1:05:26.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.01,1:05:44.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你需要什么 告诉我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need. Tell me. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.62,1:05:55.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要每个人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need everyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.82,1:05:59.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,都能继续出色工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to continue performing admirably.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.05,1:06:07.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.82,1:06:28.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定有很多问题想问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have a lotta questions for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.82,1:06:31.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只有一个要问你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only have one for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.52,1:06:37.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要星际舰队 边境防护屏障的子空间频段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need the subspace frequencies of Starfleet's border protection grids.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.02,1:06:40.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是包围着地球的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Specifically those surrounding Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.43,1:06:44.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗 回答我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christopher, answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.73,1:06:45.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 你回答一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you answer for the...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.84,1:06:47.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,为何刚刚对一个和平的星球进行种族灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genocide you just committed against a peaceful planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.96,1:06:51.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 我避免了种族灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I prevented genocide.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.63,1:06:58.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我那时候来的那地方 这只是一艘采矿船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my time, where I come from, this is a simple mining vessel.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.63,1:07:01.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我选择了用辛勤劳动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I chose a life of honest labor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.93,1:07:05.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,来养活自己和即将分娩的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to provide for myself and the wife who was expecting my child.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.83,1:07:08.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我那时离开了星球去工作...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was off planet doing my job...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.23,1:07:10.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,而你们星际联邦就眼睁睁地...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While your Federation did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.73,1:07:14.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,坐视我的同胞们 随着星球爆炸而粉身碎骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And allowed my people to burn while their planet broke in half.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.33,1:07:17.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有斯波克 他没来帮助我们 他背叛了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Spock, he didn't help us. He betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.53,1:07:19.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 你迷糊了 你的消息是错误的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no... you're confused. You're misinformed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.73,1:07:21.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗慕伦星球并未被毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romulus hasn't been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.23,1:07:22.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,它现在好端端的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's out there right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.59,1:07:24.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为某件未曾发生的事情 而谴责星际联邦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're blaming the Federation for something that hasn't happened...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.84,1:07:28.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,它发生了 我亲眼看着它发生 我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has happened! I watched it happen! I saw it happen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.14,1:07:30.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,少跟我扯什么它没发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me it didn't happen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.44,1:07:39.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我失去她的那时 我向自己保证 要他们赔偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I lost her. I promised myself retribution.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.34,1:07:43.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,25年来 我计划着 该如何向星际联邦寻仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for 25 years I planned my revenge against the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.54,1:07:47.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,忘记了所谓的正常生活是什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And forgot what it was like to live a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.14,1:07:49.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我没有忘记痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not forget the pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.94,1:07:55.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在每一个幸存的瓦肯人都与我共享痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pain that every surviving Vulcan now shares.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.14,1:07:58.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的目的 克里斯托弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My purpose, Christopher,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.24,1:07:59.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,不仅仅是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is to not simply...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.54,1:08:02.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我所爱的家园免遭破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avoid the destruction of the home that I love...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.64,1:08:09.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,还要建立一个 独立于联邦之外的罗慕伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to create a Romulus that exists free of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.44,1:08:15.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有到那时 她才能真正被拯救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see only then will she be truly saved.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.45,1:08:20.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我要摧毁 现存的每一个联邦星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I will destroy all the remaining Federation planets.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.05,1:08:22.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,就从你的开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting with yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.75,1:08:25.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就没什么好说的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we have nothing left to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.45,1:08:33.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会告诉我 解除地球防御系统的频段的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will give me the frequencies to disable Earth's defenses.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.65,1:08:40.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,人马座蠕虫 它们会寄居到你的脑干上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Centaurian slugs. They latch on to your brain stem...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.75,1:08:44.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,释放一种毒素 强迫你回答问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And release a toxin that will force you to answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.85,1:08:48.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,频段 请说吧 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frequencies please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.55,1:08:50.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗·派克 联邦星舰进取号舰长...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christopher Pike, captain of the USS Enterprise...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.79,1:08:52.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,如你所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.85,1:09:01.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你确定尼禄是往地球去了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you confirmed that Nero is heading for Earth?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.55,1:09:04.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们的行进轨道上 没有其他目的地 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their trajectory suggests no other destination, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.86,1:09:06.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, It.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.36,1:09:08.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的下一站或许是地球 但我们得假设...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth may be his next stop, but we have to assume...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.76,1:09:10.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,联邦的每一颗星球都是目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every Federation planet's a target.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.69,1:09:12.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,从椅子上起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.26,1:09:16.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果星际联邦是目标 为何不摧毁我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if the Federation is the target, why didn't they destroy us?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.46,1:09:18.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们干吗要 何必浪费武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would they? Why waste a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.33,1:09:19.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们显然不构成威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We obviously weren't a threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.46,1:09:22.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是 他说 他要我看什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not it. He said he wanted me to see something.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.36,1:09:24.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我母星的毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The destruction of my home planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.16,1:09:26.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,顺便问问 他们干吗那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did they do that, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.06,1:09:28.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗慕伦人从哪得到的那种武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where did the Romulans get that kind of weaponry?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.36,1:09:32.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,人工制造出黑洞所需的必备工程水平...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The engineering comprehension necessary to artificially create a black hole...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.06,1:09:33.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许给出了答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May suggest an answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.66,1:09:36.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,如此的技术水平 从理论上说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such technology could theoretically be manipulated...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.16,1:09:38.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,完全能制造出穿越时空的隧道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to create a tunnel through space- time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.36,1:09:40.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死 哥们 我是医生 不是物理学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it man, I am a doctor, not physicist.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.26,1:09:42.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是当真认为 他们来自未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you actually suggesting they're from the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.46,1:09:45.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你排除不可能的 剩下来的无论多荒谬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you eliminate the impossible, what ever remains, however improbable...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.56,1:09:46.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,肯定都是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.86,1:09:47.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,真有诗意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How poetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.87,1:09:49.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,那一个来自未来的愤怒罗慕伦人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what would an angry future Romulan
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.87,1:09:51.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,想从派克舰长身上得到什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want with captain Pike?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.50,1:09:54.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,作为舰长 他当然清楚舰队的所有防御资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As captain he does know details of Starfleet's defenses.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.17,1:09:55.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要做的就是追上那艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we need to do is catch up to that ship,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.87,1:09:57.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,废掉它 接管过来 再带回派克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}disable it, take it over and get Pike back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.97,1:10:00.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的技术 无论哪个方面都无法企及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are technologically outmatched in every way.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.47,1:10:02.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,试图拯救是极不合逻辑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rescue attempt would be illogical.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.47,1:10:05.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄的飞船不用曲速行进 我们才可能赶上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nero's ship would have to drop out of warp for us to overtake it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.37,1:10:08.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,那不然派技术人员试着提高我们的曲速域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what about assigning engineering crews to try and boost our warp yield?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.67,1:10:10.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的人员都在修理底层甲板上的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remaining power and crew are being used to repair radiation leaks...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.77,1:10:12.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 放射性泄漏... - 行了 行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On the lower decks... - Okay. Alright. Alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.67,1:10:13.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,以及子空间通信装置的损伤 没有它..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The damage communications. Without it...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.69,1:10:15.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯定能有办法的 - 我们无法联络星际舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's got to be some way. - We cannot contact Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.17,1:10:18.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须集合星际舰队其他飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must gather with the rest of Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.26,1:10:19.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,才能在下次遭遇时与之相抗衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To balance the terms of the next engagement,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.97,1:10:21.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,不会有下一次遭遇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There won't be a next engagement.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.47,1:10:24.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,等我们集合 已经太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time we gather it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.87,1:10:27.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,可你说 他来自未来 他知道将会发生的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you say he's from the future and knows what's gonna happen...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.01,1:10:29.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,那符合逻辑的方法 就是让自己无法预测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then the logical thing is to be unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.47,1:10:32.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你这是假设 尼禄知道事态将如何发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're assuming that Nero knows how event's are predicted to unfold.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.87,1:10:35.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反 尼禄的出现已经完全改变了历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The contrary. Nero's very presence has altered the flow of history...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.43,1:10:37.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,从他对开尔文号星舰的攻击开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beginning with the attack on the USS Kelvin,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.28,1:10:38.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,直至今天达到顶峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Culminating with the events of today,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.63,1:10:40.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,因而产生了一系列全新的事件...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thereby creating an entire new chain of incidents...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.78,1:10:43.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是双方都无法预测的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that cannot be anticipated by either party.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.78,1:10:45.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个平行宇宙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An alternate reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.48,1:10:48.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.28,1:10:49.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,不管我们的生活什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever our lives might have been
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.96,1:10:52.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果时间统一体被干扰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the time continuum was disrupted
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.68,1:10:54.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的命运也就改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our destinies have changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.98,1:10:57.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁 确定前往劳伦星系的航线 曲速三前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sulu, plot a course for the Laurentian system. Warp factor 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.58,1:10:58.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 别那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.98,1:11:03.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,回舰队所在地去开会 是对时间的极大浪费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running back to the rest of the fleet for a con fab is a massive waste of time...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.48,1:11:05.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是派克舰长离舰之前下的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These orders were issued by captain Pike when he left.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.22,1:11:06.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,他也命令我们回去救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also ordered us to go back and get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.88,1:11:09.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 你现在是舰长 你必须得...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, you are captain now. You have...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.09,1:11:10.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很明白我的职责 柯克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am aware of my responsibilities...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.38,1:11:12.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们每浪费一秒 尼禄更接近他的下个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every second we waste Nero's getting closer to his next target.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.78,1:11:15.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,不错 所以我才告诉你接受事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is correct and why I'm instructing you to accept the fact that I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.88,1:11:19.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让我们回去...而不是去追踪尼禄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not allow us to go backwards... ... instead of hunting Nero down.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.88,1:11:22.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,卫兵 押他出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security, escort him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.29,1:11:33.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Jim!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.89,1:11:40.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他扔出船去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him off this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.99,1:12:01.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 我在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.29,1:12:04.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,地点 织女三星 M级行星 危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Location: Delta Vega. Class M planet. Unsafe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.79,1:12:08.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,西北方向14公里外有一星际舰队哨站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a Starfleet outpost 14km to the northwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.69,1:12:12.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 请呆在分离舱内... - 开什么玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remain in your pod... - Oh, you've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.80,1:12:59.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,星际历2258.42\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Star date 2258.42.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.11,1:13:02.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为...因为...随便吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...For... for... Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.91,1:13:06.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,执行舰长斯波克 将我流放到织女三星上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Acting captain Spock has marooned me on Delta Vega.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.61,1:13:11.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我估计是因为 违反了保安条例49.09\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I believe to be a violation of security protocol 49.09
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.31,1:13:14.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,其对应处置 乃是将囚犯放在星...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Governing the treatment of prisoners aboard a starship.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.34,1:15:27.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·T·柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James T. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.34,1:15:31.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你怎么找到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me? - How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.84,1:15:35.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.84,1:15:40.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经是 也永远都是你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been and always shall be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.44,1:15:46.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.08,1:15:49.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.94,1:15:54.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.44,1:15:57.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,能再见到你真是无比的高兴啊 老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is remarkably pleasing to see you again old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.74,1:16:00.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是在今天发生的一切之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially after the events today.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.34,1:16:04.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我很感激您今天给我的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I appreciate what you did for me today
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.34,1:16:08.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,可如果您是斯波克 就该知道我们不是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if you were Spock, you'd know we're not friends at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.15,1:16:10.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你恨我 你以抗命为名将我流放至此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hate me. You marooned me here for mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.65,1:16:12.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 抗命 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mutiny? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.65,1:16:15.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是舰长吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not the captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.75,1:16:21.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,不不 你才是舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no... You're the captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.95,1:16:24.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,派克被抓去当人质了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pike was taken hostage.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.65,1:16:27.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,被尼禄吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By Nero?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.75,1:16:34.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对他了解多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.65,1:16:38.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是个非常棘手的罗慕伦人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a particularly troubled Romulan.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.65,1:16:41.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,请容许我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.55,1:16:43.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样简单得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.15,1:16:47.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么 - 我们的思想 融为一体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa, whoa. What are you doing? - Our minds, one and together.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.26,1:16:55.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,再过129年 一颗恒星将会爆炸 银河可能被毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}129 years from now, a star will explode and threaten to destroy the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.86,1:16:59.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我的来处 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is where I'm from Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.76,1:17:01.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.16,1:17:08.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,一颗恒星演化成超新星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A star went supernova.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.26,1:17:11.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,毁灭了其轨迹上的一切物体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consuming everything in its path.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.86,1:17:15.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我许诺过罗慕伦人 会去拯救他们的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised the Romulans that I will save their planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.66,1:17:23.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们装备了最快的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We outfitted our fastest ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.06,1:17:26.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,利用红色物质 我可以制造出一个黑洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Using red matter I would create a black hole
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.76,1:17:30.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,让它吸收正在爆发的恒星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which would absorb the exploding star.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.76,1:17:34.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还在路上时 难以置信的事情发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was on root when the unthinkable happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.16,1:17:39.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,超新星摧毁了罗慕伦星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The supernova destroyed Romulus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.07,1:17:46.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had little time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.27,1:17:52.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,只能提取出红物质 将它射入超新星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to extract the red matter and shoot it into the supernova.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.77,1:18:11.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我准备返航时 我被截击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I began my return trip I was intercepted.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.57,1:18:15.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说自己叫尼禄 - 罗慕伦帝国的最后遗民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He called himself Nero, - ...collapse of Romulan Empire.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.77,1:18:20.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我试图逃跑时 我们都被黑洞吸了进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my attempt to escape, both of us were pulled into the black hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.28,1:18:32.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄先飞出来 他是首先到达的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nero went through first. He was the first to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.18,1:18:42.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄和他的同伴 花了25年的时间等我到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nero spent the next 25 years awaiting my arrival.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.38,1:18:45.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,可 对于尼禄而言的几十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what was years for Nero
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.08,1:18:48.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我不过数秒之瞬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was only seconds for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.08,1:18:52.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我穿过了黑洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went through the black hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.38,1:18:57.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄在等着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nero was waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.58,1:19:05.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,他认为是我害他失去了自己的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He held me responsible for the loss of his world.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.58,1:19:09.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,他逮住了我的飞船 却没有杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He captured my vessel and spared my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.28,1:19:15.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,只为了一个原因 好让我了解他的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For one reason. So that I would know his pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.39,1:19:22.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,他将我传送到这里 让我亲眼目睹他的复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He beamed me here so that I can observe his vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.29,1:19:26.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,如他无力挽救自己的星球一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As he was helpless to save his planet
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.39,1:19:30.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也该无力挽救我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would be helpless to save mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.39,1:19:36.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,几十亿条生灵因他而涂炭 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billions of lives lost because of me, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.79,1:19:40.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.99,1:19:46.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅 情绪转移是思维融合的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me. Emotional transference is an effect of the mind meld.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.29,1:19:56.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以 你确实有感情 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you do feel. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.49,1:20:00.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,穿越时空 你改变了我们所有人的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going back in time you changed all our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.30,1:20:03.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim! We must go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.70,1:20:06.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,离这不远有一处星际舰队的哨站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a Starfleet outpost not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.60,1:20:09.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.90,1:20:12.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你来的那地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you came from...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.20,1:20:16.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认识我父亲么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I know my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.20,1:20:19.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.00,1:20:23.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,你经常说 你加入星际舰队是因为他的鼓励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You often spoke of him as being your inspiration for joining Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.40,1:20:27.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,他看到了你成为进取号的舰长 并引以为豪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He proudly lived to see you become captain of the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.40,1:20:28.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.70,1:20:32.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,那艘我们必须尽快送你回去的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ship we must return you to as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.30,1:20:42.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 曲速三 长官 - 航向151 三号位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Warp 3, sir. - Course 151-3.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.90,1:20:45.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 劳伦星系 长官 - 谢谢 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Laurentian system, sir. - Thank you gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.60,1:20:49.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想见我 - 是的 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanted to see me? - Yes. Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.41,1:20:52.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道詹姆斯·柯克是你的一位朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am aware that James Kirk is a friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.71,1:20:55.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认识到 如你那般支持我是颇为困难的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I recognize that supporting me as you did must have been difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.64,1:20:57.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,这算是感谢么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that thank you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.61,1:21:00.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是指出你的难处而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am simply acknowledging your difficulties.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.61,1:21:02.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,能允许我自由发言么 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission to speak freely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.51,1:21:06.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎之至 - 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I welcome it. - Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.21,1:21:09.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好 你那瓦肯脑袋疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay then. Are you out of your Vulcan mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.81,1:21:12.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,遣走柯克 你的选择符合逻辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you making a logical choice sending Kirk away?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.32,1:21:14.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧 但正确的选择呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably. But the right one?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.21,1:21:15.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道么 我们老家有句俗话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back home we've got a saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.58,1:21:17.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,"要想在肯塔基赛马会上一展身手"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're gonna ride in the Kentucky derby...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.26,1:21:19.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,"就别把最棒的种马留在厩里"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't leave your prize stallion in the stable...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.51,1:21:23.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,有趣的隐喻 医生 因为种马发挥出潜能之前...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A curious metaphor, Doctor, as a stallion must first be broken...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.31,1:21:25.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,必须先被驯服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before it can reach its potential.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.81,1:21:28.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你至少可以表现得 好像抉择艰难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God man. You could at least act like it was a hard decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.32,1:21:29.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我正打算去帮忙...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend to insist in the effort...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.85,1:21:31.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,修复与星际舰队之间的通信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To reestablish communication with Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.91,1:21:34.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过 如果我呜咽着穿过走廊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, if crew moral is better served...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.01,1:21:35.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,能对士气起到更好的鼓舞作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By my roaming the halls weeping...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.81,1:21:39.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会很乐意遵从你的医学知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would gladly defer to your medical expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.32,1:21:42.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.02,1:21:48.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,绿血死小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green blooded little goblin.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.73,1:23:10.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.94,1:23:16.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,你明白这有多令人无法接受吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You realize how unacceptable this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.14,1:23:17.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 真有趣 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fascinating. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.84,1:23:19.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我相信你们只是完成工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sure you're just doing your job,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.24,1:23:20.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,可你们就不能来得更快一点点吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But could you not come a wee bit sooner?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.64,1:23:22.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在这呆了六个月了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six months I've been here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.44,1:23:25.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,就靠舰队的蛋白质棒和许诺的大餐撑下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Living off Starfleet botty nips and a promise of a good meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.54,1:23:28.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚这是怎么回事 懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know exactly what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.04,1:23:30.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,惩罚 不是么 进行中的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok? Punishment, isn't it? Ongoing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.29,1:23:32.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了显然只是一起意外的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For something that was clearly an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.24,1:23:35.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是蒙哥马利·斯科特 - 你认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are Montgomery Scott. - You know him?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.24,1:23:37.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是我 你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's me. You're in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.24,1:23:40.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,除非附近还有个辛苦工作却快饿死的军官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless there's another hard working equally starved Starfleet officer around.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.34,1:23:43.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我 - 给我闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me. - Getup, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.34,1:23:46.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不吃东西 你吃那么个...比如一个豆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aren't doing anything. You can eat, like, a bean and you're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.84,1:23:49.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,就行了 我说的可是食物 真正的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about food, real food.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.04,1:23:51.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过你们现在来了 谢天谢地 它在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're here now. So, thank you. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.74,1:23:53.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你实际上是 那位斯科特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are in fact a Mr. Scott...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.84,1:23:55.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你提出了 在曲速飞行中进行传送的假设\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who postulated the theory of transwarp beaming?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.84,1:23:59.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说的就是那个 你以为我为什么会在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm talking about. How'd ya think I wound up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.35,1:24:01.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我跟我的导师争论了那么一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a little debate with my instructor on the issue...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.85,1:24:03.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,关于相对论性物理学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of relativistic physics...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.55,1:24:04.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,以及它对子空间航行的相符性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how it pertains to subspace travel.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.85,1:24:07.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,他似乎认为 传送某物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seemed to think that the range of transporting...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.55,1:24:08.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,比如一个柚子 其最远范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like a grapefruit...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.95,1:24:10.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,只能在100公里内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was limited to about a 100 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.85,1:24:13.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉他 我不仅能把一个柚子 从一颗星球...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him that I could not only beam a grapefruit...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.05,1:24:14.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,传送到同一星系的另一颗星球上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From one planet to the adjacent planet in the same system...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.65,1:24:17.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,顺带一提 这容易得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is easy by the way...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.35,1:24:19.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还能传送活着的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could do it with a life form.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.85,1:24:22.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我用阿齐将军的猎兔犬做实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I tested it on admiral Archer's prize beagle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.28,1:24:24.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那条狗 它怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that dog. What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.35,1:24:26.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,等它再次出现时 我会告诉你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you when it reappears.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.15,1:24:27.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 对此我确实很有罪恶感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I do feel guilty about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.75,1:24:30.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你 你曲速传送的理论是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I told you that your transwarp theory was correct?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.75,1:24:34.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,往正以曲速行驶的飞船上传送是可能的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That it is indeed possible to beam onto a ship that is travelling at warp speed?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.05,1:24:36.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是那方程式被人发现过 我会听说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that if that equation had been discovered I'd have heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.65,1:24:38.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你之所以还没听说 斯科特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reason you haven't heard of it, Mr. Scott,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.69,1:24:41.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你还没发现它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is because you haven't discovered it yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.46,1:24:50.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来自未来么 - 他是 我不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you from the future? - He is. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.36,1:24:53.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,太酷了 那时候还有三明治不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that's brilliant. Do they still have sandwiches there?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.06,1:24:56.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,她是有那么一点点危险 护盾发射器...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she's a wee bit dodgy. Shield emitters are...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.56,1:24:59.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,完全被咔嚓了 其他一些东西也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Totally bum jacked as well as a few other things.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.06,1:25:01.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.06,1:25:03.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号开始她的处女航了 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the Enterprise has had it's maiden voyage, has it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.49,1:25:05.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,她可是位娴雅淑女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is one well endowed lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.26,1:25:07.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望能亲手碰碰她的引擎舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to get my hands on her ample nossels,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.66,1:25:09.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能听懂轮机师隐语的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd pardon the engineering parlance.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.56,1:25:13.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,除了一点 就算我相信你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except, the thing is, even if I believed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.70,1:25:15.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,你来的那地方 我做过的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you're from, what I've done...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.70,1:25:17.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,顺带一提 我还没做过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which I don't, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.70,1:25:20.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,你所说的可是传送到正以快过光速行驶的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still talking about beaming aboard the Enterprise...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.06,1:25:22.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号上 而且它上面还没有适合的接受台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While she's travelling faster than light without a proper receiving pad.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.96,1:25:25.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我出去 这可不是攀登架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off there. It's not a climbing frame.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.96,1:25:27.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,曲速传送 其实就像是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The notion of transwarp beaming...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.26,1:25:30.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,企图用较小的一颗子弹去打中另一颗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is like trying to hit a bullet with a smaller bullet...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.67,1:25:33.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且是蒙着眼睛骑在马上这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whilst wearing a blindfold, riding a horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.67,1:25:34.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.67,1:25:38.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,你提出的能完成曲速传送的方程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your equation for achieving transwarp beaming.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.27,1:25:42.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,免了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of it...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.47,1:25:47.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,想象一下 我从没想到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine that. It never occurred to me...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.96,1:25:50.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,空间也是会运动的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To think of space as the thing that was moving...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.07,1:25:52.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我们一起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming with us, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.97,1:25:56.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 詹姆斯 那不是我的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Jim. That is not my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.97,1:25:59.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的命...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dest...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.27,1:26:01.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,他...那个斯波克不会相信我的 只有你能解释...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He. The other Spock is not gonna believe me, only you can explain...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.71,1:26:03.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 清楚发生的一切 - 无论何种情况下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell has happened. - Under no circumstances...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.61,1:26:04.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,都不能让他得知...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he be made aware...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.57,1:26:06.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的存在 你必须向我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of my existence. You must promise me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.57,1:26:08.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是说 我不能告诉你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're telling me I can't tell you...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.07,1:26:10.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我其实是遵循你的命令 为什么不 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I'm following you're own orders, why not? What happens?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.47,1:26:12.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 这是你不能违反的规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, this is one rule you cannot break.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.87,1:26:16.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了阻止尼禄 你必须独自指挥你的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To stop Nero, you alone must take command of your ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.57,1:26:18.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做 踩过你的尸体吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How? Over your dead body?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.41,1:26:19.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,希望不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preferably, not.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.47,1:26:22.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过 有星际舰队章程619\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, there is Starfleet regulation 619.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.68,1:26:26.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,619条规定了 任何指挥官...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}619 states that any command officer...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.08,1:26:28.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果因情绪化危及手头任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is emotionally compromised by the mission at hand...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.68,1:26:31.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,就必须放弃指挥权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must resign set command.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.58,1:26:37.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你是说 我得在情感上伤害你们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're saying that I have to emotionally compromise you... guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.48,1:26:41.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我刚刚失去了我的母星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, I just lost my planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.78,1:26:45.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你 我的情感受到极大损伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you, I am emotionally compromised.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.78,1:26:48.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只需让我表现出来即可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you must do is get me to show it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.58,1:26:51.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,好了 老弟 是死是活 我们搏它一搏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye then lady. Live or die. Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.08,1:27:00.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 走开 你不能跟我来 走开啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot come with me. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.38,1:27:06.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道么 回到现在 改变历史 那是作弊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming back in time, changing history, that's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.28,1:27:11.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从一位老朋友那里学到的诡计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A trick I learned from an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.39,1:27:23.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,生生不息 繁荣昌盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live long and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.19,1:27:44.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scott?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.79,1:27:51.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特先生 能听到我说话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scott, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.60,1:28:02.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,坚持一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.60,1:28:20.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.60,1:28:32.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,涡轮机排泄阀开启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}RELEASE VALVE.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.00,1:28:42.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,涡轮机排泄阀开启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purifier release valve activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.31,1:28:51.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right? You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.91,1:28:55.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我脑袋嗡嗡作响 全身湿漉漉 不过其他还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head's buzzing and I'm soaked, but otherwise I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.61,1:29:01.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克舰长 发现入侵者进入涡轮控制甲板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Spock, detecting unauthorized access to water turbine control board.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.41,1:29:03.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,调出视频记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up the video.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.91,1:29:11.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,保安 封锁轮机甲板 涡轮三区有入侵者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security, seal the engineering deck. We have intruders in turbine section 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.61,1:29:13.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,将激光枪设至击晕档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set phasers to stun.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.81,1:29:27.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.01,1:29:31.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.82,1:29:34.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,小甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cupcake!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.44,1:29:42.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.52,1:29:43.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我跟他一起的 - 他跟我一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm with him. - He's with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.73,1:29:45.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们正以曲速航行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're travelling at warp speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.12,1:29:47.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们是怎么传送到飞船上来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you manage to beam aboard this ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.02,1:29:48.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是天才么 自己猜啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the genius, you figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.52,1:29:50.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,作为飞船的执行舰长 我命令你回答问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As acting captain of this vessel I order you to answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.95,1:29:53.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不想说 执行舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I'm not telling, acting captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.72,1:29:56.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.02,1:29:58.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 这没法让你沮丧 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What now? That doesn't frustrate you, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.22,1:30:00.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不肯合作这点...没法让你生气吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lack of cooperation, that doesn't make you angry?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.92,1:30:04.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是舰队的一员么 - 我...是 能给我条毛巾么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you a member of Starfleet? - Um... yes. Can I get a towel?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.32,1:30:06.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我命令你向我解释 你们怎么能够被传送至...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under penalty of court martial I order you to explain to me
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.92,1:30:09.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,正以曲速飞行的飞船 否则就上军事法庭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you were able to beam aboard the ship while moving at warp?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.02,1:30:13.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 别回答他 - 你必须回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't answer him. - You will answer me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.62,1:30:17.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还是哪边都不选好了 - 你怎么了 斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd rather not take sides. - What is it with you, Spock?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.03,1:30:21.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的星球刚刚被毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your planet was just destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.33,1:30:24.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的母亲被杀了 你甚至不为所动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother murdered, and you're not even upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.23,1:30:26.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你以为 这些经历有可能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you are presuming that these experiences in any way...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.73,1:30:29.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,对我指挥飞船的能力造成妨碍 你就错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impede my ability to command this ship you are mistaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.13,1:30:32.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,然而 是你说了 恐惧是指挥官的必需品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet you were the one who said fear was necessary for command.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.63,1:30:36.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看到他的船了吗 看到他做了什么不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, did you his ship? Did you see what he did?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.43,1:30:38.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我当然看到了 - 你到底怕 还是不怕呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, of course I did. - So are you afraid or aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.93,1:30:41.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不用你来教导我情感的好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not allow you to lecture me about the merits of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.92,1:30:43.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那你干嘛不阻止我 - 离我远点 柯克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then why don't you stop me? - Step away from me Mr. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.33,1:30:47.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,完全感觉不到愤怒是什么滋味 心碎呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it like not to feel anger or heartbreak?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.23,1:30:48.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,再或者 想要肆无忌惮地...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the need to stop at nothing...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.63,1:30:50.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,为那个生下你的女人复仇的欲望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To avenge the death of the woman who gave birth to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.83,1:30:52.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 离我远点 - 你什么都感觉不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Back away from me. - You feel nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.77,1:30:55.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你连算都懒得去算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must not even compute for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.63,1:30:58.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你从来没爱过她 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You never loved her! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.74,1:31:23.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.25,1:32:03.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,医生 我不再适合这一职务了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, I am no longer fit for duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.05,1:32:08.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我已受情绪影响 我在此放弃指挥权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I relinquish my command based on the fact that I have been emotionally compromised.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.05,1:32:11.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,请在航行日志上记录下时间日期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please note the time and date in the ship's log.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.15,1:32:40.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我爱这艘飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.35,1:32:42.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,太教人兴奋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it's exciting.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.46,1:32:47.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜啊 詹姆斯 现在我们没有舰长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well congratulations, Jim. Now we've got no captain...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.76,1:32:50.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,也没他妈的大副可取代他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no God damn first officer to replace him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.16,1:32:52.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.86,1:32:55.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 派克让他当了大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Pike made him first officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.76,1:32:59.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑吧 - 多谢支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've gotta be kidding me. - Thanks for the support.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.66,1:33:06.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你知道自己在做什么 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sure hope you know what you're doing, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.86,1:33:09.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.06,1:33:16.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,注意 进取号所有船员 我是詹姆斯·柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, crew of the Enterprise, this is James Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.06,1:33:21.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克先生放弃指挥权 晋升我为执行舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Spock has resigned commission and advanced me to acting captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.86,1:33:25.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我明白大家都希望能与舰队会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're all expecting a regroup with the fleet,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.26,1:33:27.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我要改变航线 追踪往地球而去的敌舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm ordering a pursuit course of the enemy ship to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.98,1:33:31.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要所有部门 在10分钟内做好战斗准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want all departments at battle stations and ready in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.27,1:33:36.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是我们死 就是他们亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either we're going down or they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.27,1:33:38.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克讲话完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.27,1:33:48.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,说出你的想法吧 斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak your mind Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.17,1:33:52.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,那样很不明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be unwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.17,1:33:56.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,必要之事永远都不会不明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is necessary is never unwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.47,1:34:01.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我仍像小时候一般好斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am as conflicted as I once was as a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.27,1:34:05.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,你永远都是两个世界的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will always be a child of two worlds.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.97,1:34:10.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很感激这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am grateful for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.77,1:34:13.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,也感激有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.28,1:34:18.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对那个夺去母亲生命的人感到愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel anger for the one who took mother's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.78,1:34:22.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我无法控制的愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An anger I cannot control.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.28,1:34:31.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我相信她会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe, as she would say...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.58,1:34:34.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,"不必勉强"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not try to.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.78,1:34:39.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,有一次你问我 为何会娶你母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked me once why I married your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.58,1:34:47.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我娶她是因为爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I married her because I loved her.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.18,1:34:57.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何我们都得悄悄地登上尼禄的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever the case we need to get aboard Nero's ship undetected.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.22,1:34:59.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能就那么挥着枪冲进去 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just can't just go in there guns blazing, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.18,1:35:00.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you to...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.98,1:35:03.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 柯克舰长 柯克舰长 - 什么事 切科夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain Kirk. Captain Kirk. - Yes, Chekov. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.89,1:35:06.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,基于纳拉达号 从瓦肯星系飞出的航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Based on the Nerada's course from Vulcan...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.48,1:35:09.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,我预计尼禄会从土星飞过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have projected that Nero will travel pass Saturn.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.37,1:35:12.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像你说的 不能让尼禄看到 不然会被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you said we need to stay invisible to Nero or he'll destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.89,1:35:15.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果斯科特先生 能让我们以曲速四前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Mr. Scott can get us to warp factor 4...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.49,1:35:20.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后在土星卫星 比如泰坦星后面脱离曲速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we drop out of warp behind one of Saturn's moons, say Titan.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.09,1:35:22.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,土星光环的磁场畸变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The magnetic distortion from the planet's rings...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.59,1:35:24.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,能保证我们不被尼禄的传感器察觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will make us invisible to Nero's sensors.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.99,1:35:27.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,在那里 只要钻头还未启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From there, as long as the drill is not activated...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.49,1:35:28.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以被传送上敌舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can beam aboard the enemy ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.93,1:35:31.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,不错 这个可行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, that might work.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.29,1:35:34.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 等一下 小子 你几岁了 - 17岁 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait a minute kid, how old are you? - 17, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.39,1:35:35.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 他才17岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh good, he's 17.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.73,1:35:37.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.39,1:35:41.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,切科夫先生是正确的 我可以证明他的理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Chekov is correct. I can confirm his telemetry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.29,1:35:43.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果苏鲁先生 能够将我们带到特定位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Mr. Sulu is able to maneuver us into position
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.39,1:35:46.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以传送到尼禄的船上 偷回黑洞装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can beam aboard Nero's ship, steal back the black hole device
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.19,1:35:48.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,可能的话 再带回派克舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if possible bring back captain Pike.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.99,1:35:51.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会允许你那么做的 斯波克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't allow you to do that Mr. Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.70,1:35:54.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗慕伦人与瓦肯人拥有共同的祖先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romulans and Vulcans share a common ancestry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.90,1:35:57.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们文化的相似之处可以令我更加容易地...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our cultural similarities will make it easier...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.40,1:35:59.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,侵入飞船电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me to access the ship's computer...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.00,1:36:00.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,找出装置的所在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To locate the device.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.40,1:36:03.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有 我母亲是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also my mother was human.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.48,1:36:06.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,这使得地球成了我仅剩的家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which makes Earth the only home I have left.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.90,1:36:15.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我跟你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.10,1:36:19.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想引用规章制度 可我知道你会不屑一顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would cite regulation, but I know you will simply ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.00,1:36:24.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看 我们已经开始彼此了解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? We are getting to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.41,1:36:42.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备钻头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare the drill.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.01,1:37:03.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,飞船停止 三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All stop in 3... 2... 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.91,1:37:11.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我五秒钟 四分之一的脉冲推力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me 1/4 impulse burst for 5 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.16,1:37:13.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的我用推进器搞定 听我信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do the rest with thrusters. On my mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.08,1:37:14.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.51,1:37:16.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,开动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.32,1:37:45.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,传送室 我们已经在泰坦星上方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transporter room. We are in position above Titan.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.37,1:37:48.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的 做得好 苏鲁先生 真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Fine job Mr. Sulu, well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.47,1:37:50.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,情况如何 斯考提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we Scotty?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.17,1:37:52.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信 长官 飞船已经就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievably sir. The ship is in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.72,1:37:57.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,无论发生何事 苏鲁先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever happens Mr. Sulu,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.62,1:38:00.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你认为 我们已有战略优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think you have the tactical advantage...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.02,1:38:03.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,直接开火 不管我们是否还在船上 这是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fire on that ship even if we're still on board. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.32,1:38:06.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.32,1:38:09.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,等我们准备传送回来时 我们会联系进取号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise we'll contact the Enterprise when we're ready to be beamed back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.22,1:38:13.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,祝您好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.43,1:38:28.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会回来的 - 最好如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will be back. - You better be.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.73,1:38:33.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会一直监视着你的频率 - 谢谢你 妮欧塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be monitoring your frequency. - Thank you, Nyota.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.03,1:38:51.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 她的名字原来是妮欧塔啊 - 我无可奉告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So her first name's Nyota? - I have no comment on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.83,1:38:55.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果那敌舰设计用的是普通常识的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oky doky then. If there's any common sense in the design of the enemy's ship
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.02,1:38:58.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我应该会把你们送到货舱某处 不会被看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be putting you somewhere in the cargo bay, shouldn't be a soul in site.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.54,1:39:00.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,启动吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Energize.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.04,1:39:45.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 有星际舰队的人上船来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we have Starfleet officers aboard the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.74,1:39:49.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 其中一个是瓦肯人 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One of them is Vulcan. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.85,1:39:55.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿伊尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ayel!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.55,1:40:10.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我掩护你 - 你确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll cover ya. - Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.98,1:40:13.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I've gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.15,1:40:36.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道它在哪吗 黑洞装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where it is? The black hole device?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.36,1:40:40.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有派克舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And captain Pike.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.56,1:41:03.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.56,1:41:06.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经启动了钻头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have activated the drill.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.56,1:41:08.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,通讯与传送都不能用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Communication and transportation are inoperative.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.26,1:41:09.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁 拜托告诉我你抓到时机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sulu, please tell me you have them.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.86,1:41:11.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,否则我们没法把他们传回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise we won't be able to beam them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.50,1:41:14.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克和斯波克现在只能靠自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk and Spock are on their own now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.57,1:41:35.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我预见到一个新的难题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I foresee a complication. The design of this ship...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.27,1:41:36.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们飞船设计的先进性 远远超乎我的预期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is far more advanced than I have anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.77,1:41:39.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,声纹与脸部识别分析系统启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voice print and face recognition analysis enabled.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.67,1:41:41.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 斯波克大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back ambassador Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.87,1:41:43.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.67,1:41:47.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 你的制造者是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, what is your manufacturing origin?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.67,1:41:52.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,星际历2387 由瓦肯科学院委托制造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Star date 2387. Commissioned by the Vulcan Science Academy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.17,1:41:57.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来你一直对我隐瞒了某些重要信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears that you have been keeping important information from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.87,1:41:59.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能够让这东西飞起来 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be able to fly this thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.81,1:42:02.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,有什么东西告诉我 我已经有这能力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something tells me I already have.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.67,1:42:05.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 - 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck. - Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.57,1:42:08.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们这计划的成功率 就统计学上来说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The statistical likelihood that our plan will succeed...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.42,1:42:10.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不到4.3% - 会起作用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is less than 4,3%. - It'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.18,1:42:12.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,万一我回不去 请告诉乌胡拉中尉...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the event that I do not return please tell Lt. Uhura...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.08,1:42:14.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 会奏效的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.68,1:42:26.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.58,1:42:37.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,相关程序启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Startup sequence initiated.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.09,1:43:24.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄 命令你的人关掉钻头 不然我就...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nero, order your men to disable the drill or I will...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.79,1:43:37.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从地球历史中认识了你的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your face from Earth's history.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.90,1:44:25.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·T·柯克被认为是个伟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James T. Kirk was considered to be a great man.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.30,1:44:28.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,他成为了联邦星舰进取号的舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went on to captain the USS Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.21,1:44:30.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,但 那是在另一个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was another life.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.11,1:44:33.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,被我夺走了的世界 正如我对你父亲所做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A life I will deprive you of just like I did your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.81,1:45:10.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,尼禄舰长 瓦肯飞船被盗 钻头已被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Nero. The Vulcan ship's been taken. The drill has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.41,1:45:15.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 斯波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock! Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.52,1:45:35.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 开启一个通信频道 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open a channel. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.62,1:45:38.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 我就知道 一有机会我就该杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, I knew I should have killed you when I had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.92,1:45:40.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在此没收这艘非法获得的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hereby confiscate this illegally obtained ship...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.96,1:45:43.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,并命令你们无条件交出飞船投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And order you to surrender your vessel. No terms.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.02,1:45:44.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,除掉那艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ship... take it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.52,1:45:48.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 长官 如果引发红色物质... - 我要斯波克现在死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, if you ignite the red matter.. - I want the Spock dead now!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.33,1:46:05.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他进行曲速飞行了 - 追上他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He went to warp. - Go after him.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.16,1:46:06.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.53,1:46:39.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们这物种比我预期的脆弱太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your species is even weaker than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.03,1:46:45.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你连话都没法说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't even speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.13,1:46:48.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.83,1:46:51.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了你的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.14,1:47:18.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.54,1:47:21.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克大使 你正处于碰撞航线上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambassador Spock, you are on a collision course.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.94,1:47:24.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,发射所有武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.34,1:47:34.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,导弹飞来 如果被击中 红色物质将被引发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming missiles. If the ship is hit, the red matter will be ignited.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.64,1:47:37.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.45,1:47:44.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 我发现了另一艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I've picked up another ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.55,1:48:08.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在这做什么 - 遵循命令啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing here? - Following orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.76,1:48:31.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号 就是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise now!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.26,1:48:55.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,时机正好啊 斯考提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice timing Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.86,1:48:58.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还从没同时把三个人 自两个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never beamed three people from two targets
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.16,1:48:59.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,传到同一个接收台上呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Onto one pad before.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.96,1:49:03.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 - 老骨头 - 我扶住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jim. - Bones. - I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.66,1:49:08.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.16,1:49:11.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 敌舰已丧失动力 他们的护盾消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, the enemy ship is loosing power. They're shields are down.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.47,1:49:14.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 连线他们 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hail them now. - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.77,1:49:52.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是联邦星舰进取号舰长 詹姆斯·T·柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is captain James T. Kirk of the USS Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.07,1:49:54.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们的飞船正处于危机之中 离奇异点太近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ship is compromised. You're too close to the singularity
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.77,1:49:58.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,若没援助无法幸存 我们很乐意伸出援手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To survive without assistance which we are willing to provide.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.98,1:50:02.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.88,1:50:04.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,向他们表示怜悯 或许是与罗慕伦人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showing them compassion may be the only way...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.51,1:50:05.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,达成和平的唯一方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make peace with Romulus, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.51,1:50:08.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,很合逻辑 斯波克 我想你会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's logical, Spock. Thought you'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.88,1:50:11.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 其实不然 这次不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really. Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.58,1:50:15.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我宁可千遍地忍受罗慕伦帝国消亡的痛楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would rather suffer the end of Romulus a thousand times,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.88,1:50:20.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我宁愿痛苦地死去 也不愿接受你们的援助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would rather die in agony than accept assistance from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.38,1:50:22.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你就受死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.28,1:50:24.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备激光炮 发射我们的所有武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arm phasers. Fire everything we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.62,1:50:26.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.49,1:51:13.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 苏鲁 让我们回家吧 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sulu, let's go home. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.79,1:51:26.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们为什么不曲速飞行 - 正飞着呢 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why aren't we at warp? - We are, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.29,1:51:28.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克呼叫轮机部 让我们离开这里 斯考提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk to engineering. Get us out of here, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.53,1:51:31.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈说对了 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bet your ass captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.60,1:51:35.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 我们被引力井吸住了 它吸住我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we're caught in the gravity well. It's got us.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.73,1:51:37.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,开启最大曲速 冲出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to maximum warp. Push it!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.30,1:51:40.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会让她给出所有力量的 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm giving it all she's got captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.60,1:51:51.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,她所有的还不足够 你还有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All she's got isn't good enough. What else you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.13,1:51:53.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果我们发射能量核 然后引爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok, if we eject the core and detonate the blast...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.86,1:51:57.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,冲击波应该能推我们出去 不过我不能保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be enough to push us away. I can't promise anything though.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.60,1:52:02.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,动手 动手 动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it! Do it! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.20,1:52:04.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 把这地方清空快 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clear the area. Go! - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.62,1:53:33.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.62,1:53:44.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是我们的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not our father.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.12,1:53:56.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的瓦肯人如此之少 我们不能彼此忽视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are so few Vulcans left we cannot afford to ignore each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.83,1:54:00.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么把柯克送上船来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why did you send Kirk aboard
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.44,1:54:01.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你自己就能解释清楚一切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you alone could have explained the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.83,1:54:03.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们需要彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you needed each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.83,1:54:08.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能透露你们将共同完成的创举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could not deprive you of the revelation of all that you can accomplish together.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.23,1:54:11.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,以及你们尚未察觉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of a friendship that will define you both.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.63,1:54:14.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,将造就你们特质的友谊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In ways you cannot yet realize.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.23,1:54:17.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么让他保住秘密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you persuade him to keep your secret?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.83,1:54:21.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,他以为 若是他食言了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He inferred that universe ending paradoxes would ensue
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.13,1:54:22.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,将出现宇宙终结之像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should he break his promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.77,1:54:25.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,你撒谎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lied?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.43,1:54:28.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我...只是暗示 - 这是赌博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. I implied. - A gamble?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.63,1:54:30.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An act of faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.43,1:54:34.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你将来 在星际舰队中能继续这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One I hope you will repeat in the future in Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.13,1:54:35.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,面临灭绝 唯一符合逻辑的便是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the face of extinction it is only logical...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.96,1:54:38.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我放弃星际舰队使命 帮助重建我们的民族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I resign my Starfleet commission And help rebuild our race.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.63,1:54:41.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,可是 你完全可以分身两处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet you can be in two places at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.23,1:54:45.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我主张你继续留在星际舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I urge you to remain in Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.34,1:54:49.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已找到一颗适合建立瓦肯殖民地的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already located a suitable planet on which to establish a Vulcan colony.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.64,1:54:54.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯波克 这一次 帮你自己个忙吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, in this case do yourself a favor...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.94,1:54:59.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,把逻辑推一边 跟着感觉走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put aside logic, do what feels right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.44,1:55:07.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,由于我惯用的告别方式 会显得额外自私\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since my customary farewell would appear awfully self serving...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.94,1:55:11.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以我只说祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall simply say good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.64,1:55:26.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,本会议是为詹姆斯·提比留斯·柯克召开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This assembly calls captain James Tiberius Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.94,1:55:30.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的机智勇敢和对战友们的无私奉献...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your inspirational valor and supreme dedication to your comrades...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.24,1:55:33.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,正符合这一职务的最高传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is in keeping with the highest traditions of service.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.35,1:55:38.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,亦为你 船员们以及星际联邦增添无上荣光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And reflect at most credit to yourself, your crew and the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.05,1:55:42.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸能颁发给你这一勋章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my honor to award you with this commendation.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.45,1:55:51.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队命令28455号 特此宣布 你直接向...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By Starfleet order 28455, you are hereby directed to report to admiral Pike...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.45,1:55:55.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,联邦星舰进取号派克将军报告 接替职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}USS Enterprise, for duty as his relief.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.35,1:56:05.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我接过您的担子 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I relieve you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.65,1:56:08.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我放心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am relieved.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.35,1:56:12.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 先生 - 恭喜 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, sir. - Congratulations, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.75,1:56:16.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲一定会以你为荣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father would be proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.36,1:56:47.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,推进器满速了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thrusters on full.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.46,1:56:50.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,正按您的命令 调适推进器与脉冲引擎 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Firing thrusters and impulse engines at your command, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.26,1:56:53.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,武器系统与护盾准备完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon systems and shields on standby.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.16,1:56:56.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,港口控制室报告完毕 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dock control reports ready, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.06,1:57:01.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,老骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.16,1:57:04.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,扣好安全带哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.37,1:57:09.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯考提 情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, how we doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.17,1:57:12.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,重锂室已达到最高水平 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dilithium chambers at maximum captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.87,1:57:15.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.47,1:57:20.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 准备发动推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sulu, prepare to engage thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.27,1:57:24.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,请准许我登舰 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission to come aboard, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.07,1:57:27.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,请求批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.57,1:57:29.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,既然您尚未敲定大副人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you have yet to select a first officer,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.77,1:57:32.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在此不才自荐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respectfully I would like to submit my candidacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.27,1:57:36.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,若您需要 我可以提供推荐信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should you desire I can provide character references.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.27,1:57:39.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的荣幸 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be my honor commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.17,1:57:45.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,部署推进器 苏鲁先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maneuvering thrusters Mr. Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.67,1:57:50.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 推进器准备完毕 - 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thrusters on standby. - Take us out.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.77,1:57:52.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye aye, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.78,1:58:00.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙 最后的边境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SPACE, THE FINAL FRONTIER
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.68,1:58:05.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是进取号星舰的航程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}THESE ARE THE VOYAGES OF THE STARSHIP ENTERPRISE
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.28,1:58:10.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,她将继续去 探索未知的新世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}HER ONGOING MISSION: TO EXPLORE STRANGE NEW WORLDS,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.88,1:58:15.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,找寻新的生命以及新的文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TO SEEK OUT NEW LIFE FORMS AND NEW CIVILISATIONS
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.18,1:58:20.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢地航向前人所未至的领域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TO BOLDLY GO WHERE NO ONE HAS GONE BEFORE.
